le cloth and stock it up with premium domestic and international drinks) as told to me by the WC. They do not charge extra for this, it is included.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jduran186@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1201812448,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208423.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jen419","Id":208423,"Name":"jen419","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"86f83c099a349e26b4b39789d266eebc","RawContent":"\n Thx, thats what they did for my friends wedding in Puerto Plata and that sounds more reasonable that what another resort was offering to me.","Attachments":[],"Id":192036,"PostDate":1202765220,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> Thx, thats what they did for my friends wedding in Puerto Plata and that sounds more reasonable that what another resort was offering to me.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8cc39b3127ccec5b04ffd9d710000