ion is a buffett and open bar (3 hours) for $2500.\n \n We are also doing a private bar 1\/2 before and 1\/2 hour after the ceremony right next to the gazebo. That is priced per person\/per hour.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Hi Tami, the Paradisus is part of the Sol Melia hotel line right?","Attachments":[],"Id":192404,"PostDate":1202783192,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>foxytv<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I'm not getting married at Dreams, but I would think there would be different package options.<br \/> <br \/> Included in our beach reception is a buffett and open bar (3 hours) for $2500.<br \/> <br \/> We are also doing a private bar 1\/2 before and 1\/2 hour after the ceremony right next to the gazebo. That is priced per person\/per hour.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Hi Tami, the Paradisus is part of the Sol Melia hotel line right?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8cc39b3127ccec5b04ffd9d7100000060O08YaNWzVw4B7efCQ\/cC\/f%3D0\/ps%3