m colors, bronzes work best for me. Hair will have extensions and be pinned loosley<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/106457dfd1fdd925.bmp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/106457dfd1feb3e1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span><center><\/span><br><br><span>Jenetta - JPMO<\/span><br><br><span>Dreams Resort June 16th, 2007<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;0\/st\/20070616\/e\/Our+Wedding+Day%21%21%21\/dt\/-1\/k\/114e\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...114e\/event.png<\/a><span><a href=\"<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/pregnancy.baby-gaga.com\/\">http:\/\/pregnancy.baby-gaga.com\/<\/a><span>\"><img src=\"<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.baby-gaga.com\/p\/dev065br___.png\">http:\/\/tickers.baby-gaga.com\/p\/dev065br___.png<\/a><span>\" alt=\"pregnant\" border=\"0\" \/><\/a>[link=<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.baby-gaga.com\/%5D%5Bimage\">http:\/\/www.baby-gaga.com\/][image<\/a><span> noborder]<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.baby-gaga.com\/t\/dogdogcrd20080310_-8_Maurice+Sean.png%5B\/image%5D%5B\/link%5D\">http:\/\/tick...<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"msjlpolk@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1142537220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206725.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":60,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoTyp