ful, just wanting more ideas. I love this hair style, just dont know how hard it would be to do it on my own.... any suggestions hair stylists&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i214.photobucket.com\/albums\/cc237\/kevinsbride\/hair2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i214.photobucket.com\/albums\/cc237\/kevinsbride\/hair1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i214.photobucket.com\/albums\/cc237\/kevinsbride\/hair.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":127720,"PostDate":1192863743,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thought I would bring this post back to life a little.... not that the pics werent beautiful, just wanting more ideas. I love this hair style, just dont know how hard it would be to do it on my own.... any suggestions hair stylists<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i214.photobucket.com\/albums\/cc237\/kevinsbride\/hair2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i214.photobucket.com\/albums\/cc237\/kevinsbride\/hair1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i214.photobucket.com\/albums\/cc237\/kevinsbride\/hair.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i83.photobucket.com\/albums\/j302\/snarnold\/thegirls-2.jpg\">http:\/\/i83.photobucket.com\/albums\/j3...thegirls-2.jpg<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;128\/st\/20080607\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/66ac\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...66ac\/event.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i83.photobucket.com\/albums\/j302\/snarnold\/ferret2.jpg\">http:\/\/i83.photobucket.com\/albums\/j3...ld\/ferret2.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sarah.arnold@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1187539402,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207643.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":82,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Saraha","Id":207643,"Name":"Saraha","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"43392741d1856eeceb3decc946aee34d","RawContent":"&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/bump.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Bump\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/bump.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Bump\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/bump.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Bump\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n Well, since my other laptop died, I lost all the friggin&#039; hair ideas that I had worked so many months to save. &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/doh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Doh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n So I am trying to re-assess my hair options. Lots of the pics in this thread are showing up as &#039;x&#039; for me, which is a bummer ... but I&#039;m starting to get some new ideas and find some of the same ideas I had saved prior.\n \n Lots of new ladies on BDW lately, so keep this thread rolling and add some of your fave hair and\/or make-up ideas.\n \n I keep going back to this one for hair...\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/hairupdo.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n But I also like this ... although it might be awfully formal for a beach wedding ... with little chance of staying in place, perhaps.\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/hair_updo_8n.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/hair_updo_2n.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n And of course, Edyta&#039;s hair is an all-time favorite. I am just afraid it wouldn&#039;t hold it&#039;s shape b\/c my hair is so thin...\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/hair11.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/hair10.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":202244,"PostDate":1203626733,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/bump.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Bump\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/bump.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Bump\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/bump.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Bump\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Well, since my other laptop died, I lost all the friggin' hair ideas that I had worked so many months to save. <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/doh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Doh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> So I am trying to re-assess my hair options. Lots of the pics in this thread are showing up as 'x' for me, which is a bummer ... but I'm starting to get some new ideas and find some of the same ideas I had saved prior.<br \/> <br \/> Lots of new ladies on BDW lately, so keep this thread rolling and add some of your fave hair and\/or make-up ideas.<br \/> <br \/> I keep going back to this one for hair...<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/hairupdo.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> But I also like this ... although it might be awfully formal for a beach wedding ... with little chance of staying in place, perhaps.<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/hair_updo_8n.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/hair_updo_2n.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> And of course, Edyta's hair is an all-time favorite. I am just afraid it wouldn't hold it's shape b\/c my hair is so thin...<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/hair11.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/hair10.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/Slide1-7.jpg\">http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m...v\/Slide1-7.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"scwinetastings@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1177639140,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/pro