nt-style:italic\"&gt;I will have a hard time because there are not too many wedding pictures of women with locs or braids that I like. but the one good thing I have is that my stylist here can do my hair before I leave because it will last for about 1-2 weeks.\n \n \n \n Are you and Cain on billboards.&lt;img src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/thewave.gif\"]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/thewave.gif\"[\/url] border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Thewave\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Check these out...\n &lt;img src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v19\/thefineprijnt2\/Fauryn3-vi.jpg\"]http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v19\/thefineprijnt2\/Fauryn3-vi.jpg\"[\/url] border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n if your hair is short... this would look cute with a flower! &lt;img src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/kindlypogmothoin.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2007\/08\/gordon.JPG\"]http:\/\/kindlypogmothoin.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2007\/08\/gordon.JPG\"[\/url] border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n Long locks... this would look good with a veil\n [IMG]http:\/\/www.katcaverly.com\/mt-static\/archives\/images2\/katdread_042806.jpg[\n \/IMG]\n &lt;img src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/nedjetti.com\/images\/gallery\/nhs2\/image2.jpg\"]http:\/\/nedjetti.com\/images\/gallery\/nhs2\/image2.jpg\"[\/url] border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n im considering clip in extentions! kinda nervous since ive never worn them.","Attachments":[],"Id":213800,"PostDate":1204457302,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>LadyP<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I will have a hard time because there are not too many wedding pictures of women with locs or braids that I like. but the one good thing I have is that my stylist here can do my hair before I leave because it will last for about 1-2 weeks.<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Are you and Cain on billboards.<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/thewave.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Thewave\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Check these out...<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v19\/thefineprijnt2\/Fauryn3-vi.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> if your hair is short... this would look cute with a flower! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/kindlypogmothoin.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2007\/08\/gordon.JPG\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Long locks... this would look good with a veil<br \/> [IMG]http:\/\/www.katcaverly.com\/mt-static\/archives\/images2\/katdread_042806.jpg[<br \/> \/IMG]<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/nedjetti.com\/images\/gallery\/nhs2\/image2.jpg\" border=\"0\" al