'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i252.photobucket.com\/albums\/hh9\/sherrywendt\/HAIR-updo7096.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i252.photobucket.com\/albums\/hh9\/sherrywendt\/47b7d920b3127cce87546951b38d0000002.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i252.photobucket.com\/albums\/hh9\/sherrywendt\/Wedding%20Pro%20Pics\/Wedding%20Pro%20PIcs%20%20Faves\/173-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i252.photobucket.com\/albums\/h...aves\/173-1.jpg<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f76\/maui-pro-pics-30724\/\">My Pro Wedding Pics<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/sherrys-maui-wedding-review-33306\/\">My Wedding Review<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sherrywendt@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"184.64.140.86","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1204512886,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208704.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sherry","Id":208704,"Name":"Sherry","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"32c14ba6940c8d64843eec47150a4144","RawContent":"Regarding the pics below (sent by saraha). HOW does her veil stay in?! Any ideas? This is how I want my hair for sure. If only i could look as beautiful as Avril! \n So what is under that veil to keep it on? A big giant knot? LOL\n \n \n \n \n \n &lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Saraha&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Thought I would bring this post back to life a little.... not that the pics werent beautiful, just wanting more ideas. I love this hair style, just dont know how hard it would be to do it on my own.... any suggestions hair stylists&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i214.photobucket.com\/albums\/cc237\/kevinsbride\/hair2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i214.photobucket.com\/albums\/cc237\/kevinsbride\/hair1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i214.photobucket.com\/albums\/cc237\/kevinsbride\/hair.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":241678,"PostDate":1206565115,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Regarding the pics below (sent by saraha). HOW does her veil stay in?! Any ideas? This is how I want my hair for sure. If only i could look as beautiful as Avril! <br \/> So what is under that veil to keep it on? A big giant knot? LOL<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Saraha<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Thought I would bring this post back to life a little.... not that the pics werent beautiful, just wanting more ideas. I love this hair style, just dont know how hard it would be to do it on my own.... any suggestions hair stylists<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i214.photobucket.com\/albums\/cc237\/kevinsbride\/hair2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i214.photobucket.com\/albums\/cc237\/kevinsbride\/hair1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i214.photobucket.com\/albums\/cc237\/kevinsbride\/hair.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-