{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9c078f93de4faf85fdac1e739a794d65","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;BlissfulMsMiranda&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Maybe I&#039;m just a n00b when it comes to searching on the internet, but I&#039;ve had a really, really hard time finding pics of wedding inspiration hairstyles for women with short hair! My hair is quite short ... and &amp;quot;fine&amp;quot; (as my hairdresser says LOL) ... do you girls know of any decent resources? The pics that I have come across are so &#039;80s and brutal it makes me want to cry and think I&#039;ll just end up leaving my hair exactly like it is in this picture of me: \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/img66.imageshack.us\/img66\/3170\/meax8.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Try here Miranda... \n When I initially was engaged my hair was short and I was stressing trying to find non 80&#039;s freaky hairstyles and that site had some nice ones. \n \n I have also seen a lot of the little headband things short haired brides are wearing.. I can&#039;t seem to find a pic right now; but you can get a sparkly thin headband that wraps around your head and ties at the bottom. I think that I saw &#039;Kate&#039; from that show &amp;quot;John and Kate plus 8&amp;quot; on &#039;Say Yes To The Dress&amp;quot; and she had one that was so cute.","Attachments":[],"Id":627524,"PostDate":1237570411,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>BlissfulMsMiranda<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Maybe I'm just a n00b when it comes to searching on the internet, but I've had a really, really hard time finding pics of wedding inspiration hairstyles for women with short hair! My hair is quite short ... and \"fine\" (as my hairdresser says LOL) ... do you girls know of any decent resources? The pics that I have come across are so '80s and brutal it makes me want to cry and think I'll just end up leaving my hair exactly like it is in this picture of me: <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/img66.imageshack.us\/img66\/3170\/meax8.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Try here Miranda... <br \/> When I initially was engaged my hair was short and I was stressing trying to find non 80's freaky hairstyles and that site had some nice ones. <br \/> <br \/> I have also seen a lot of the little headband things short haired brides are wearing.. I can't seem to find a pic right now; but you can get a sparkly thin headband that wraps around your head and ties at the bottom. I think that I saw 'Kate' from that show \"John and Kate plus 8\" on 'Say Yes To The Dress\" and she had one that was so cute.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Shannon<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingwire.com\/RichandShannon\">http:\/\/www.weddingwire.com\/RichandShannon<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"shannonettaro@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1219857173,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211413.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sunsetbride1","Id":211413,"Name":"sunsetbride1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e5a315095ac9b7de04675f3302837d22","RawContent":"Wow thanks for all the great inspiration ladies!!","Attachments":[],"Id":627535,"PostDate":1237570810,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Wow thanks for all the great inspiration ladies!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yaeloksenberg@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.65.175.12","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1233961020,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214694.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":78,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"YaelM","Id":214694,"Name":"YaelM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eaf47a9296b9787bd80dccd110f5c481","RawContent":"I haven&#039;t decided if I will do half up or all to the side. I basically never wear my hair up (or to the side) so not sure if I would look like myself if I did that look.. Ill probably experiment to see what works best with my hair (and extensions to thicken it!) and my dress. \n These are my two looks that I like\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i210.photobucket.com\/albums\/bb46\/nadinecloss\/halfup.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i210.photobucket.com\/albums\/bb46\/nadinecloss\/williams_2006.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":627773,"PostDate":1237581677,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I haven't decided if I will do half up or all to the side. I basically never wear my hair up (or to the side) so not sure if I would look like myself if I did that look.. Ill probably experiment to see what works best with my hair (and extensions to thicken it!) and my dress. <br \/> These are my two looks that I like<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i210.photobucket.com\/albums\/bb46\/nadinecloss\/halfup.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i210.photobucket.com\/albums\/bb46\/nadinecloss\/williams_2006.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i210.photobucket.com\/albums\/bb46\/nadinecloss\/rocks.jpg\">http:\/\/i210.photobucket.com\/albums\/b...loss\/rocks.jpg<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/nadine-s-dreams-huatulco-review-12-29-09-a-53920\/\">My Dreams Huatulco Wedding Review<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f128\/nadine-s-planning-thread-52947\/\">My Planning Thread<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f76\/nadine-s-wedding-day-after-photots-54891\/#post1161576\">Photographer Review<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"nadinecloss@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1215618060,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210423.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"*Nadine*","Id":210423,"Name":"*Nadine*","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"84246b4715191a2126f71be331a90c0e","RawContent":"This thread has been sooooooo helpful in making an inspiration file for my hair stylist. I am having some issues. I have curly hair, but my FI loves when I blow it out strait and lightly curl it with a big curling iron. Also... I want it up to prevent frizzing in the wind and humidity, but he wants it half down like I normally wear it. I have a big collage of pics that I am working with and will see what my stylist can come up with. I&#039;ll post my collage when i dump it in to photobucket.","Attachments":[],"Id":634251,"PostDate":1238171711,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This thread has been sooooooo helpful in making an inspiration file for my hair stylist. I am having some issues. I have curly hair, but my FI loves when I blow it out strait and lightly curl it with a big curling iron. Also... I want it up to prevent frizzing in the wind and humidity, but he wants it half down like I normally wear it. I have a big collage of pics that I am working with and will see what my stylist can come up with. I'll post my collage when i dump it in to photobucket.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20091017\/e\/Our+Wedding+in+Jamaica\/dt\/-1\/k\/25d6\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...25d6\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"beverly.brenner@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1232310220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214077.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":99,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"budgetjamaicabride","Id":214077,"Name":"budgetjamaicabride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"73bccb8529af6358b85429ed5b2f2eee","RawContent":"Here is the make-up look I want to re-create (I will do moer neutral colors): \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b9dd06b3127ccec6e3721a55c400000040O00IcMmTJq3asge3nwg\/cC\/f%3D0\/ps%3D50\/r%3D0\/rx%3D720\/ry%3D480\/\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n This is the look I want for my hair:\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b9dc30b3127ccec603d99fd35300000060O00IcMmTJq3asge3nwg\/cC\/f%3D0\/ps%3D50\/r%3D0\/rx%3D720\/ry%3D480\/\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":634305,"PostDate":1238173967,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here is the make-up look I want to re-create (I will do moer neutral colors): <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b9dd06b3127ccec6e3721a55c400000040O00IcMmTJq3asge3nwg\/cC\/f%3D0\/ps%3D50\/r%3D0\/rx%3D720\/ry%3D480\/\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> This is the look I want for my hair:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b9dc30b3127ccec603d99fd35300000060O00IcMmTJq3asge3nwg\/cC\/f%3D0\/ps%3D50\/r%3D0\/rx%3D720\/ry%3D480\/\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Dreams Do Come True<\/span><br><span>Brandon and Heather<\/span><br><span>May 21st or 28th, 2011<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"heather.n.brandon@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1236185921,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215477.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsBane","Id":215477,"Name":"FutureMrsBane","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3121fae36c24202ec596b281c1bb70d2","RawContent":"Sorry those are soo BIG! ^","Attachments":[],"Id":634332,"PostDate":1238175006,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Sorry those are soo BIG! ^\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Dreams Do Come True<\/span><br><span>Brandon and Heather<\/span><br><span>May 21st or 28th, 2011<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"heather.n.brandon@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1236185921,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215477.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsBane","Id":215477,"Name":"FutureMrsBane","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e3d91f41db23a1a16f64444ff7809028","RawContent":"These are all such great ideas!! I am debating wearing my hair half up, or wearing swept to the side to keep it out of my face...I don&#039;t know! I know it can be windy in RM, so I don&#039;t know what to do!","Attachments":[],"Id":634464,"PostDate":1238180887,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                These are all such great ideas!! I am debating wearing my hair half up, or wearing swept to the side to keep it out of my face...I don't know! I know it can be windy in RM, so I don't know what to do!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>~Joanna~<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;130\/st\/20090627\/e\/Our+Wedding%21\/k\/674b\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...674b\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"JoLo908@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1196874763,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208008.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoLo908","Id":208008,"Name":"JoLo908","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d3969f2a0c019dae4a520e11281acbef","RawContent":"Hi ladies...\n \n I just tried to start a new thread not realizing there was one here already.. &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/shitfan.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Shitfan\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n Anyhow, just wanting to post my picture of my hair. I have short hair and I have been letting it grow out.. Here it is.\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/img14.imageshack.us\/img14\/9546\/2512458907a18d0046c1o10.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":642014,"PostDate":1238800539,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi ladies...<br \/> <br \/> I just tried to start a new thread not realizing there was one here already.. <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/shitfan.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Shitfan\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Anyhow, just wanting to post my picture of my hair. I have short hair and I have been letting it grow out.. Here it is.<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/img14.imageshack.us\/img14\/9546\/2512458907a18d0046c1o10.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;405\/st\/20090515\/e\/our+wedding+day+.\/dt\/21\/k\/c140\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...c140\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"silmaym@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1211568900,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209557.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":66,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cancunbride","Id":209557,"Name":"cancunbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"55ca3fdcdf1fa24a569db728464ee7aa","RawContent":"^that is so cute.\n \n I think I&#039;m gonna wear my hair down and slightly wavy, I am worried about it reverting in the humidity, I have super curly hair. I think I&#039;ll just spray the heck out of it with some anti-humidity hairspray and hope for the best. I don&#039;t really want to wear it up because that&#039;s just not me.","Attachments":[],"Id":643294,"PostDate":1238960002,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                ^that is so cute.<br \/> <br \/> I think I'm gonna wear my hair down and slightly wavy, I am worried about it reverting in the humidity, I have super curly hair. I think I'll just spray the heck out of it with some anti-humidity hairspray and hope for the best. I don't really want to wear it up because that's just not me.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"christiangirl81@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1236035815,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215418.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"iwantadreamswedding","Id":215418,"Name":"iwantadreamswedding","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"