91e01a956f","RawContent":"&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i719.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww197\/Tikki_Gurl\/stace.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i719.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww197\/Tikki_Gurl\/Photo28.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i719.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww197\/Tikki_Gurl\/stace2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n I want my hair down or half up and curly, makeup to be natural on the eyes with false lashes, and a coral pink color for the lips....I have 7 days to figure it out!\n \n Im a makeup\/hair artist so it will be easy, Im actually doing my friends hair for my wedding!","Attachments":[],"Id":658052,"PostDate":1239968709,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i719.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww197\/Tikki_Gurl\/stace.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i719.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww197\/Tikki_Gurl\/Photo28.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i719.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww197\/Tikki_Gurl\/stace2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> I want my hair down or half up and curly, makeup to be natural on the eyes with false lashes, and a coral pink color for the lips....I have 7 days to figure it out!<br \/> <br \/> Im a makeup\/hair artist so it will be easy, Im actually doing my friends hair for my wedding!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;460\/st\/20090423\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/c6ac\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...c6ac\/event.png<\/a><br><br><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i719.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww197\/Tikki_Gurl\/n505790686_659493_600.jpg\">http:\/\/i719.photobucket.com\/albums\/w...659493_600.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"stacey_mua@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1239202268,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216568.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":68,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tikki_gurl","Id":216568,"Name":"Tikki_gurl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c106e362fdaf50e8bb15000c48d8ca1c","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Tikki_gurl&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i719.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww197\/Tikki_Gurl\/stace.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i719.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww197\/Tikki_Gurl\/Photo28.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i719.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww197\/Tikki_Gurl\/stace2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n I want my hair down or half up and curly, makeup to be natural on the eyes with false lashes, and a coral pink color for the lips....I have 7 days to figure it out!\n \n Im a makeup\/hair artist so it will be easy, Im actually doing my friends hair for my wedding!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Did you do the hair in these photos yourself? How do you get the wave to look so perfect and hold? I really want to do my hair myself, but I&#039;m super hair inept.","Attachments":[],"Id":658324,"PostDate":1239982764,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Tikki_gurl<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i719.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww197\/Tikki_Gurl\/stace.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i719.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww197\/Tikki_Gurl\/Photo28.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i719.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww197\/Tikki_Gurl\/stace2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> I want my hair down or half up and curly, makeup to be natural on the eyes with false lashes, and a coral pink color for the lips....I have 7 days to figure it out!<br \/> <br \/> Im a makeup\/hair artist so it will be easy, Im actually doing my friends hair for my wedding!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Did you do the hair in these photos yourself? How do you get the wave to look so perfect and hold? I really want to do my hair myself, but I'm super hair inept.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>LeAnne & John<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wTFJpHP\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...pHP\/weight.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i67.photobucket.com\/albums\/h304\/loveisblonde2\/bls63.jpg\">http:\/\/i67.photobucket.com\/albums\/h3...nde2\/bls63.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"Collegetigrrrl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.232.88.151","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1211476084,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209540.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":94,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sapphire723","Id":209540,"Name":"Sapphire723","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1c44af0851dcd00b9c9c21f8d02c876d","RawContent":"I love J.lo so I thought I would steal some of her looks! I want natural looks for the beach ceremony.\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i666.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv21\/shellrg72\/Jennifer20Lopez-GLA-000312.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;[\/IMG]\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i666.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv21\/shellrg72\/Jennifer20Lopez-49.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;[\/IMG]","Attachments":[],"Id":658393,"PostDate":1239985560,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I love J.lo so I thought I would steal some of her looks! I want natural looks for the beach ceremony.<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i666.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv21\/shellrg72\/Jennifer20Lopez-GLA-000312.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>[\/IMG]<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i666.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv21\/shellrg72\/Jennifer20Lopez-49.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>[\/IMG]\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http&#58;\/\/i666.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv21\/shellrg72\/dreams%20wedding\/0484.jpg\">http&#58;\/\/i666.photobucket.com\/albums\/v...dding\/0484.jpg<\/a><br \/>\n<span>[IMG]<a href=\"<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http&#58;\/\/www.thebump.com\/?utm_source=ticker&utm_medium=HTML&utm_campaign=ti\">http&#58;\/\/www.thebump.com\/?utm_source=ticker&utm_medium=HTML&utm_campaign=ti<\/a><span> ckers\"><img src=\"<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http&#58;\/\/global.thebump.com\/tools\/tickers\/tt375c9.aspx\">http&#58;\/\/global.thebump.com\/tools\/tickers\/tt375c9.aspx<\/a><span>\" alt=\" Trying to Conceive Ticker\" border=\"0\" \/><\/a>[\/IMG]<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mrballerina@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1206662615,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208938.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon To Be Mrs. Gomez","Id":208938,"Name":"Soon To Be Mrs. Gomez","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"10892c1074a8fef230f3541dceebdeca","RawContent":"I like Taylor Swift&#039;s hair style in her love story video. There is a demo on how to create the hair style here: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=E6jEHuyKAzg\"&gt;YouTube - Taylor Swift Love Story Updo&lt;\/a&gt;. It looks complicated but I have a while to practice and grow my hair a bit!","Attachments":[],"Id":660085,"PostDate":1240161351,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I like Taylor Swift's hair style in her love story video. There is a demo on how to create the hair style here: <a href='http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=E6jEHuyKAzg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>YouTube - Taylor Swift Love Story Updo<\/a>. It looks complicated but I have a while to practice and grow my hair a bit!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;46;130\/st\/20110909\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/5\/k\/63ce\/s-event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...ce\/s-event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"donnagrant@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1235393883,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215177.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Peachy","Id":215177,"Name":"Peachy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"386268c86970ebc659694a448e043f4a","RawContent":"I have fallen in love with this hairstyle. It&#039;s exactly what I pictured for a beach wedding...\n \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i591.photobucket.com\/albums\/ss356\/jennierin\/hair12.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i591.photobucket.com\/albums\/ss356\/jennierin\/hair11.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n \n \n I&#039;m still on the fence whether to leave it in a low messy chignon or have pinned loosely to the nape of my neck and let it out long and curly.","Attachments":[],"Id":661647,"PostDate":1240266028,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I have fallen in love with this hairstyle. It's exactly what I pictured for a beach wedding...<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i591.photobucket.com\/albums\/ss356\/jennierin\/hair12.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i591.photobucket.com\/albums\/ss356\/jennierin\/hair11.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> I'm still on the fence whether to leave it in a low messy chignon or have pinned loosely to the nape of my neck and let it out long and curly.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i591.photobucket.com\/albums\/ss356\/jennierin\/DSC04983.jpg\">http:\/\/i591.photobucket.com\/albums\/s...n\/DSC04983.jpg<\/a><br><span>First Kiss as a Mr & Mrs!!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jenreid1@rogers.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1222695727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212021.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":82,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennierin","Id":212021,"Name":"jennierin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ff276e71f844dac34beb6709971a0863","RawContent":"Oooh, I love this messy chignon look!!!!\n I don&#039;t have many ideas so this is a great resource for me!","Attachments":[],"Id":675016,"PostDate":1241118086,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Oooh, I love this messy chignon look!!!!<br \/> I don't have many ideas so this is a great resource for me!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i719.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww198\/chantim\/Wedding\/Reception-CN.jpg\">http:\/\/i719.photobucket.com\/albums\/w...ception-CN.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"morel.chantal@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1228167270,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212955.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":94,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Chanti","Id":212955,"Name":"Chanti","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fefe60c64c99dc706a522defa9533067","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;jennierin&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I have fallen in love with this hairstyle. It&#039;s exactly what I pictured for a beach wedding...\n \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i591.photobucket.com\/albums\/ss356\/jennierin\/hair12.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i591.photobucket.com\/albums\/ss356\/jennierin\/hair11.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n \n \n I&#039;m still on the fence whether to leave it in a low messy chignon or have pinned loosely to the nape of my neck and let it out long and curly.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;wow! i LOVE THIS ONE!","Attachments":[],"Id":691284,"PostDate":1242317577,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>jennierin<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I have fallen in love with this hairstyle. It's exactly what I pictured for a beach wedding...<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i591.photobucket.com\/albums\/ss356\/jennierin\/hair12.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i591.photobucket.com\/albums\/ss356\/jennierin\/hair11.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> I'm still on the fence whether to leave it in a low messy chignon or have pinned loosely to the nape of my neck and let it out long and curly.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>wow! i LOVE THIS ONE!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keilagronewold@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1238694180,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\