ile of things from the wedding. &amp;nbsp;Quite a bit is not worth shipping (due to damage\/fragile\/weight, etc), but here are some things that people might want!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;All items are somewhat negotiable - buyer will pay exact shipping &amp;amp; paypal fees (it&#039;s 3% + .35) as I&#039;ll send an invoice. &amp;nbsp;It gives both buyer and seller something like 145 days of protection that way. &amp;nbsp;I ship out asap, once I&#039;ve received payment.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;As I find more things, I&#039;ll post them to this thread and update the bought\/sold. &amp;nbsp;Feel free to ask any questions!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AVAILABLE ITEMS:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ampersand Sign ($) &lt;\/strong&gt;- Photo Prop - $8&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81132]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80972]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80971]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unused Chapstick Label Paper &lt;\/strong&gt;- 5 sheets - Avery 5163 - $3 or $1\/sheet (each sheet has 10 labels, which are cut in half to make 20 chapstick)&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81133]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Blacklight Pen for RSVPS&lt;\/strong&gt; - Use this to write numbers in black light on your rsvp cards, in case guests don&#039;t write their names on the return - $2&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81134]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Her Captain\/His First Mate Chair Signs &lt;\/strong&gt;- $20&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81136]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81135]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Crystal Ribbon For DIY Projects &lt;\/strong&gt;- $3&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81137]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81138]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Silk Flower Bouquet Holder for DIY Bouquets &lt;\/strong&gt;- $7&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81139]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weddings\/Destination Weddings for Dummies&lt;\/strong&gt; - FREE (just shipping)&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81141]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dress Barn Beaded Silver Sandals &lt;\/strong&gt;- Says size 11M but fits closer to a 10. Couldnt&#039; wear because of my broken foot, so still brand new. &amp;nbsp;$10&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81140]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flower Girl Ball&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt; - Will leave in shells and the ribbon on (can change out) - $5&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81143]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fiskars 1.5 inch hole punch&lt;\/strong&gt; - Used for door hangers - $12&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81142]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Girls Size 9 Crocs&lt;\/strong&gt; - Glittered with ModPodge - $2&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81145]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81144]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jordan 455 White Dress&lt;\/strong&gt; - Size 14 - Used for TTD Pictures - PERFECT condition. &amp;nbsp;Good for TTD or could be used for ceremony&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81146]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81149]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81148]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81147]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ringbearer\/Flower Girl Signs&lt;\/strong&gt; - $25 or $15\/each&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81150]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81151]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Small Sifter &lt;\/strong&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"https:\/\/www.amazon.com\/gp\/product\/B001713L84\/ref=oh_aui_detailpage_o04_s00?ie=UTF8&amp;amp;psc=1\"&gt;OXO Good Grips 3-Inch Mini Strainer&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;Used to sift sand for sand ceremony - $6&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81152]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Martha Stewart Starfish Hole Punch&lt;\/strong&gt; - $12&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81153]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New With Tags - Blue Lace Panties&lt;\/strong&gt; - Size 7 - $5&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81154]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform White \"I do\" Flip Flops &lt;\/strong&gt;- $15&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81155]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81156]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RSVP Envelopes&lt;\/strong&gt; - $5&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81157]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Starfish Charms&lt;\/strong&gt; - 18 of them - $2&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81159]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81158]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wedding Ducks&lt;\/strong&gt; - $3&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81160]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;45 feet of blue jewelry wire&lt;\/strong&gt; (12 or 14 gauge, can&#039;t find it) - was going to use for name hangers - $8&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81161]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You can message me here on this site! &amp;nbsp;I can email pictures if needed, as well!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895327,"PostDate":1430770961,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm starting to sort through the HUGE pile of things from the wedding. \u00a0Quite a bit is not worth shipping (due to damage\/fragile\/weight, etc), but here are some things that people might want!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>All items are somewhat negotiable - buyer will pay exact shipping & paypal fees (it's 3% + .35) as I'll send an invoice. \u00a0It gives both buyer and seller something like 145 days of protection that way. \u00a0I ship out asap, once I've received payment.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>As I find more things, I'll post them to this thread and update the bought\/sold. \u00a0Feel free to ask any questions!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>AVAILABLE ITEMS:<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Ampersand Sign ($) <\/strong>- Photo Prop - $8<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/81132-sign-for-photos\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18020\/sml_gallery_275696_18020_1502004.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='& Sign For Photos'  width='113' height='200'  alt='& Sign For Photos' id='sml_image_view_81132' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/80972-m-g504\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18012\/sml_gallery_275696_18012_4608389.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='M G504'  width='133' height='200'  alt='M G504' id='sml_image_view_80972' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/80971-m-g501\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18012\/sml_gallery_275696_18012_2656759.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='M G501'  width='200' height='134'  alt='M G501' id='sml_image_view_80971' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><strong>Unused Chapstick Label Paper <\/strong>- 5 sheets - Avery 5163 - $3 or $1\/sheet (each sheet has 10 labels, which are cut in half to make 20 chapstick)<\/div>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/81133-avery-labels-for-chapstick\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18020\/sml_gallery_275696_18020_395392.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Avery Labels For Chapstick'  width='113' height='200'  alt='Avery Labels For Chapstick' id='sml_image_view_81133' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><strong>New Blacklight Pen for RSVPS<\/strong> - Use this to write numbers in black light on your rsvp cards, in case guests don't write their names on the return - $2<\/div>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/81134-black-light-pen\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18020\/sml_gallery_275696_18020_2843283.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='black light Pen'  width='113' height='200'  alt='black light Pen' id='sml_image_view_81134' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><strong>Her Captain\/His First Mate Chair Signs <\/strong>- $20<\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/81136-chair-signs-2\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18020\/sml_gallery_275696_18020_2524880.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='chair signs (2)'  width='113' height='200'  alt='chair signs (2)' id='sml_image_view_81136' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/81135-chair-signs-1\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18020\/sml_gallery_275696_18020_519608.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='chair signs (1)'  width='113' height='200'  alt='chair signs (1)' id='sml_image_view_81135' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div><strong>Crystal Ribbon For DIY Projects <\/strong>- $3<\/div>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/81137-crystal-ribbon-1\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18020\/sml_gallery_275696_18020_903980.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Crystal Ribbon (1)'  width='113' height='200'  alt='Crystal Ribbon (1)' id='sml_image_view_81137' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/81138-crystal-ribbon-2\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18020\/sml_gallery_275696_18020_2124209.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Crystal Ribbon (2)'  width='113' height='200'  alt='Crystal Ribbon (2)' id='sml_image_view_81138' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Silk Flower Bouquet Holder for DIY Bouquets <\/strong>- $7<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/81139-diy-flower-bouquet-holder\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18020\/sml_gallery_275696_18020_718586.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='DIY Flower Bouquet Holder'  width='113' height='200'  alt='DIY Flower Bouquet Holder' id='sml_image_view_81139' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><strong>Weddings\/Destination Weddings for Dummies<\/strong> - FREE (just shipping)<\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/81141-dummies-books\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18020\/sml_gallery_275696_18020_2045837.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Dummies Books'  width='113' height='200'  alt='Dummies Books' id='sml_image_view_81141' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><strong>Dress Barn Beaded Silver Sandals <\/strong>- Says size 11M but fits closer to a 10. Couldnt' wear because of my broken foot, so still brand new. \u00a0$10<\/div>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/81140-dress-barn-starfish-beaded-sandals-size-11\/' class='bbc