{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":17595,"Author":{"Id":281603,"Name":"NMungarro","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1430737865,"Content":"How is all the wedding planning going? Are you as anxious and nervous as I am! lol","PostKey":"67b4abbabf9eb998c2ff424d53f38a8d","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":17599,"Author":{"Id":274657,"Name":"misbosox","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274657.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1430752713,"Content":"It's going good. Pretty much done.  I only have few more things to finish.  We started our music play lists, menu cards, hangover kits.  I'm almost done with those.  Now just have to book my hair appointments.  Been waiting to hear from my BM's to see who wants theirs done.  It felt very real this weekend I picked up my dress from alterations!!  Can't believe it's almost month away.   The only thing stressing on I have two couples that haven't booked yet that are coming.   The deadline is May 12. My TA just messaged me the resort is booked full the week we are there.  So once I release rooms and if any not booked they just gonna have to hope something opens up.","PostKey":"b5bdd3e9aa27533d34f8716977048c5c","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":17600,"Author":{"Id":274657,"Name":"misbosox","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274657.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1430752762,"Content":"How's your planning going?","PostKey":"ed8b192f25dee6915b241bd59937e7a1","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":17601,"Author":{"Id":281603,"Name":"NMungarro","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1430756295,"Content":"<p>Its coming along, our deadline is the 11th to have all of our wedding stuff done and paid for (d\u00e9cor, music, etc) so I'm trying to stay organized and most importantly calm lol.\u00a0 I just finished our welcome bags and I'm almost done with our escort seating cards and table numbers.\u00a0 Are you getting the basic sound system and bringing an ipod? I have yet to start our music playlist, that's my next big project. You picked up your dress, how exciting!! My father in law was convinced the resort wouldn't be busy in June, when we looked online, he was shocked to see that they didn't have any more rooms that week! Hopefully they book soon, fingers crossed<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck with the rest of your planning, June will be here before we know it!<\/p>\n","PostKey":"b35ddc2d9c362d7558397b679d9bc951","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
