y<\/span><br><br><strong>24 Booked + Bride and Groom<\/strong><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/robandlindseypearson\">www.mywedding.com\/robandlindseypearson<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lindsey.jensen@plexus.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1257536769,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223118.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JuneWeddingDreams","Id":223118,"Name":"JuneWeddingDreams","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"430d4ca6be05c929d88151738f7fe08d","RawContent":"Here you go girls... \n \n We were married on 10-10-09 at the Grand Lido Negril - and it was great. We had 66 people and they really went above and beyond to accomodate us. They made the reception room gorgeous. set up a bar, dj table, head table, cake table and a big enough dance floor. \n \n here are some shots I took:\n place card table\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i96.photobucket.com\/albums\/l169\/courte4me\/tablecards.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n reception room\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i96.photobucket.com\/albums\/l169\/courte4me\/receptionroom.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n head table\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i96.photobucket.com\/albums\/l169\/courte4me\/morronesattheheadtable.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n table centerpieces\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i96.photobucket.com\/albums\/l169\/courte4me\/lyndhursttable.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n finally... cake table\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i96.photobucket.com\/albums\/l169\/courte4me\/caketablealone.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n enjoy - but I highly recco. Jamaica at the Grand Lido - it really was FAB\n ~Courte","Attachments":[],"Id":930586,"PostDate":1258515185,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here you go girls... <br \/> <br \/> We were married on 10-10-09 at the Grand Lido Negril - and it was great. We had 66 people and they really went above and beyond to accomodate us. They made the reception room gorgeous. set up a bar, dj table, head table, cake table and a big enough dance floor. <br \/> <br \/> here are some shots I took:<br \/> place card table<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i96.photobucket.com\/albums\/l169\/courte4me\/tablecards.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> reception room<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i96.photobucket.com\/albums\/l169\/courte4me\/receptionroom.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> head table<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i96.photobucket.com\/albums\/l169\/courte4me\/morronesattheheadtable.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> table centerpieces<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i96.photobucket.com\/albums\/l169\/courte4me\/lyndhursttable.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> finally... cake table<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i96.photobucket.com\/albums\/l169\/courte4me\/caketablealone.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> enjoy - but I highly recco. Jamaica at the Grand Lido - it really was FAB<br \/> ~Courte\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i96.photobucket.com\/albums\/l169\/courte4me\/caporronesticker1.jpg\">http:\/\/i96.photobucket.com\/albums\/l1...nesticker1.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"caporrone@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1219144954,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211266.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"caporrone","Id":211266,"Name":"caporrone","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ec17cb73bb38dba7f04ffea1050e6250","RawContent":"Thanks for sharing your pics! Everything looks great! I love the place cards!","Attachments":[],"Id":930822,"PostDate":1258548894,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                 