image in my head I hope it all comes out right!","Attachments":[],"Id":938091,"PostDate":1259030771,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Well I don't have pics yet but here is my idea: <br \/> <br \/> Have the Mexican blanket\/serape as a table runner:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i804.photobucket.com\/albums\/yy330\/alkoch8\/images.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> I ordered these maracas and I am going to put a pair or two on each table tied together by raffia.<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i804.photobucket.com\/albums\/yy330\/alkoch8\/fiesta_2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> And in the middle have a photo holder similar to this (I am in the middle of making them) hold up our table names (events from when we have been together such as: graduation, engagement, trips, College Days, Love at first site) and pictures of those times. <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i804.photobucket.com\/albums\/yy330\/alkoch8\/bird-holder.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Finally there will be tea lights all around that. I have an image in my head I hope it all comes out right!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Annette.parrent@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1243988180,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218061.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"alkoch","Id":218061,"Name":"alkoch","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"98fa93a978f17286906d07f3ba6b04a9","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;cogswellgray&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;i looove the umbrella place cards. i would totally do that, but for some reason I don&#039;t feel the need to tell people where to sit...hmmm&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I have been debating that too! We only have 35 people coming, so can&#039;t they figure that out for themselves?? I don&#039;t really want to have to do table cards\/#s either..","Attachments":[],"Id":938223,"PostDate":1259036934,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20p