> User misbosox (274657)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":5,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":245,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1888787,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":275069,"Name":"lydiasusi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275069.jpg?_r=1389282466","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1425901487,"LastPoster":{"Id":278025,"Name":"jsparrow10","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":43,"Preview":{"Id":1888787,"PostDate":1425901487,"PostContent":"Okay, 52 days till I'm in Mexico for my wedding. \u00a0 I have collected all the decorations that I ne...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lydiasusi1@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"97.94.99.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1384516767,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275069.jpg?_r=1389282466","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lydiasusi","Id":275069,"Name":"lydiasusi","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"138.229.193.9","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78886,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1fdab296d4691bddf81b01ebc80b2651","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Okay, 52 days till I&#039;m in Mexico for my wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have collected all the decorations that I need. &amp;nbsp;Patron bottles, fake flowers, loteria cards, virgin mary candles, \"mexican\" restaurant candles, and xmas lights.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am really concerned on how I will get this glass over without it being broken, but I have a bit of a lot. 8 patron bottles, 8 mary candles, and 8 restaurant candle votives. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;At my work we get deliviries weekly, of plastic type balloon bag things to prevent anything breaking. &amp;nbsp;Would it be useful to use these and check in my luggage or do carry on?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m just worried that if I get a smaller suitcase, I will not be able to get all the stuff over. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m also concerned that if I do carry on through customs, I will get hassled due to not having all my recipes for my purchases. &amp;nbsp;If the products are open, will that make it easier? How can you sell open products?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;AAAAAAHHH! HELP&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888787,"PostDate":1425901487,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Okay, 52 days till I'm in Mexico for my wedding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have collected all the decorations that I need. \u00a0Patron bottles, fake flowers, loteria cards, virgin mary candles, \"mexican\" restaurant candles, and xmas lights.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am really concerned on how I will get this glass over without it being broken, but I have a bit of a lot. 8 patron bottles, 8 mary candles, and 8 restaurant candle votives. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>At my work we get deliviries weekly, of plastic type balloon bag things to prevent anything breaking. \u00a0Would it be useful to use these and check in my luggage or do carry on?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm just worried that if I get a smaller suitcase, I will not be able to get all the stuff over. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm also concerned that if I do carry on through customs, I will get hassled due to not having all my recipes for my purchases. \u00a0If the products are open, will that make it easier? How can you sell open products?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>AAAAAAHHH! HELP<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lydiasusi1@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"97.94.99.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1384516767,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275069.jpg?_r=1389282466","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lydiasusi","Id":275069,"Name":"lydiasusi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78886,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"354a09770a2129067f247ec616509592","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am bringing a ton of glassware and breakable things over..the key is in the packing. Lucky I am getting married to an engineer to help pack the stuff. I think it is way too much for any carry on. We bought ginormous duffles (as long as they are 50 lbs we can check them ) and stuffed them with the stuff....the way we prevented breaks was by very careful packing. Things were&amp;nbsp;wrapped in tissue\/bubble wrap etc and then packaged in&amp;nbsp;boxes.&amp;nbsp;Bubble wrap padding the boxes inside the duffle. So yes, we are checking 150lbs of just decorations not counting our&amp;nbsp;clothes&amp;nbsp;bags etc.&amp;nbsp;Hope this works!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888818,"PostDate":1425933831,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am bringing a ton of glassware and breakable things over..the key is in the packing. Lucky I am getting married to an engineer to help pack the stuff. I think it is way too much for any carry on. We bought ginormous duffles (as long as they are 50 lbs we can check them ) and stuffed them with the stuff....the way we prevented breaks was by very careful packing. Things were\u00a0wrapped in tissue\/bubble wrap etc and then packaged in\u00a0boxes.\u00a0Bubble wrap padding the boxes inside the duffle. So yes, we are checking 150lbs of just decorations not counting our\u00a0clothes\u00a0bags etc.\u00a0Hope this works!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nadia.bozanich@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406718672,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nadiakat17","Id":279229,"Name":"nadiakat17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"138.229.193.9","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78886,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"31d13e1a38c1e81722dde8740b7bb433","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;wow. Looks like I have a lot of work to do!!!!&amp;nbsp; :wacko:&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888873,"PostDate":1425985283,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>wow. Looks like I have a lot of work to do!!!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wacko.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wacko:' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lydiasusi1@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"97.94.99.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1384516767,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275069.jpg?_r=1389282466","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lydiasusi","Id":275069,"Name":"lydiasusi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78886,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"24bdbbd7fbdb801db2eb7d3a7b6b515f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Lydia&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congrats on your upcoming wedding!&amp;nbsp; I`m&amp;nbsp; just curious- What are you doing with the loteria cards.&amp;nbsp; We love that game and didn`t even think of incorporating in our week.&amp;nbsp; would love to hear what you are doing!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888874,"PostDate":1425987150,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Lydia<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats on your upcoming wedding!\u00a0 I`m\u00a0 just curious- What are you doing with the loteria cards.\u00a0 We love that game and didn`t even think of incorporating in our week.\u00a0 would love to hear what you are doing!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10747;0\/st\/20150620\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f3ff\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1396964852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.220.24.175","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78886,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b3b438990269ee220d914dbb3bcfe26f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I would do carry on especially if it&#039;s breakable. What size are the Patron bottles because liquids need to be under 3 or 4 oz if you check it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888951,"PostDate":1426027442,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I would do carry on especially if it's breakable. What size are the Patron bottles because liquids need to be under 3 or 4 oz if you check it.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jsparrow@kent.edu","IpAddress":"74.218.117.250","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1400499942,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jsparrow10","Id":278025,"Name":"jsparrow10","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78886","Title":"Carry On Or Luggage To Be Checked In","LastPostDate":1426027442},"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
