dding.com\/forum\/t35430\">http:...<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ethrondson@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1208397487,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209120.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"EricaG","Id":209120,"Name":"EricaG","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fbd58cb2bb6653c1dc69c70b10983a4d","RawContent":"What does your wedding cake look like? Post pics of your cake(s), or pics of the cake you would like to have at your DW &amp;amp;\/or AHR. \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i141.photobucket.com\/albums\/r51\/ethrondson\/Jan2020062008120whitened20and20crop.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n Here is the cake that I want for my AHR. I will be changing it slightly, as it will be white and teal, and the solid white will be at the bottom and the solid teal will be at the top. My Mom has made several wedding cakes, and this time I want to make it with her assistance! Not really sure what is happening with the DW cake yet!","Attachments":[],"Id":331569,"PostDate":1212886587,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                What does your wedding cake look like?