      <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Mel<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Here was ours.<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i228.photobucket.com\/albums\/ee180\/b101rat\/wedding\/Wedding_Reception32-1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Mmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmm....that looks soooooooo yummy!!!!!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i141.photobucket.com\/albums\/r51\/ethrondson\/Pro%20wedding%20pics\/DSC_0038-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i141.photobucket.com\/albums\/r...DSC_0038-1.jpg<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i141.photobucket.com\/albums\/r51\/ethrondson\/Pro%20wedding%20pics\/DSC_0463-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i141.photobucket.com\/albums\/r...DSC_0463-1.jpg<\/a><br><span>My wedding review of the Grand Palladium Palace, Punta Cana, Dominican Republic<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t35125\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t35125<\/a><br><br><span>Our Professional Wedding and TTD Pictures by Photo Souvenir<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t35430\">http:...<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ethrondson@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1208397487,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209120.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"EricaG","Id":209120,"Name":"EricaG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"abe97f03191a0f202fa4c7b0bb2f7297","RawContent":"I don&#039;t have a pic of my wedding cake in Jamaica, but here is the closest to it - \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/Wedding%20Cakes\/ourweddingcake-beaches-1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n I just spoke to our bakery for the AHR and I chose this cake from their website, but requested that she color the icing a light blue - \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/Wedding%20Cakes\/LaiLaiweddingcake-ShoreThing.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":365591,"PostDate":1215012837,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I don't have a pic of my wedding cake in Jamaica, but here is the closest to it - <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/Wedding%20Cakes\/ourweddingcake-beaches-1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the 