ight! This is my first reply. Anyway...\n \n I mentioned in my into post that I did my wedding on a really small budget. This was our cake. It was blue buttercream frosting with white cake and a fresh fruit layer in the middle (strawberries, kiwis, bananas, and pineapples and smashed up and SO yummy!). The cake fed about 50 and we got a sheet cake that fed 90. We had 75 guests and very little left over! All done by a grocery store baker for $250.\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i187.photobucket.com\/albums\/x123\/jebuellwedding\/1GBWeddingPics123.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":475213,"PostDate":1223440071,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I hope I can do the picture alright! This is my first reply. Anyway...<br \/> <br \/> I mentioned in my into post that I did my wedding on a really small budget. This was our cake. It was blue buttercream frosting with white cake and a fresh fruit layer in the middle (strawberries, kiwis, bananas, and pineapples and smashed up and SO yummy!). The cake fed about 50 and we got a sheet cake that fed 90. We had 75 guests and very little left over! All done by a grocery store baker for $250.<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i187.photobucket.com\/albums\/x123\/jebuellwedding\/1GBWeddingPics123.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jebuell@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1223169797,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212127.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsVanPelt","Id":212127,"Name":"MrsVanPelt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fea34ff023257cc6dbeff702173fa4d9","RawContent":"Here&#039;s Mine...Can&#039;t decide whether I want a seashell cake topper or one of the humorous ones with the groom trying to run away from the bride or just leave it as is. Any opinions?\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/72016\/width\/525\/height\/525\/flags\/LL\"&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":477452,"PostDate":1223661520,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here's Mine...Can't decide whether I want a seashell cake topper or one of the humorous ones with the groom trying to run away from the bride or just leave it as is. Any opinions?<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/72016\/width\/525\/height\/525\/flags\/LL\"><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheig