                font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>zeugirdorxela<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Here are a few cakes I am deciding between for our AHR. <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.sweetnothingscakes.com\/gallery\/images\/photos\/SweetNothingsCakes\/weddings\/14.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.sweetnothingscakes.com\/gallery\/images\/photos\/SweetNothingsCakes\/weddings\/25.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.sweetnothingscakes.com\/gallery\/images\/photos\/SweetNothingsCakes\/weddings\/44.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> Wow! These all look sooo amazing! I really like the first one though!<br \/> Very unique!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Melissa + Jason = Forever<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/ticker.7910.org\/as1cEWycg360700NTQxNzJvfDY0ODUwc3xBIExvdmUgQXMgRGVlcCBBcyBUaGUgT2NlYW4.gif\">http:\/\/ticker.7910.org\/as1cEWycg3607...GUgT2NlYW4.gif<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"missybee99@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1217710079,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210943.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":77,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missybee99","Id":210943,"Name":"missybee99","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5c54c2627a5bbbc17b2d8b56f3c23f2b","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;meltanirie&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Here&#039;s Mine...Can&#039;t decide whether I want a seashell cake topper or one of the humorous ones with the groom trying to run away from the bride or just leave it as is. Any opinions?\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/attachment.php?s=dfbfb5df2e227e10a1ec66dacd051e68&amp;amp;attachmentid=2643\"&gt;Attachment 2643&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I like this cake, it looks good and yummy. Are your color combo the same, green and brown? For the cake topper, the humorous one might be a hit or just leave it as is. I want a similar cake, stacked but only 2 layers with different shapes. \n \n Does anyone know if bakers normally would charge extra for having different shapes versus the same shape, e.g. all rounds.?","Attachments":[],"Id":517500,"PostDate":1227509835,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>meltanirie<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Here's Mine...Can't decide whether I want a seashell cake topper or one of the humorous ones with the groom trying to run away from the bride or just leave it as is. Any opinions?<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/attachment.php?s=dfbfb5df2e227e10a1ec66dacd051e68&attachmentid=2643' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Attachment 2643<\/a><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I like this cake, it looks good and yummy. Are your color combo the same, green and brown? For the cake topper, the humorous one might be a hit or just leave it as is. I want a similar cake, stacked but only 2 layers with different shapes. <br \/> <br \/> Does anyone know if bakers normally would charge extra for having different shapes versus the same shape, e.g. all rounds.?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i><strong>Alexandra<\/strong><\/i><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.wayfarerschapel.org\/weddings\/\">http:\/\/www.wayfarerschapel.org\/weddings\/<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.queenmary.com\/index.php?page=weddings\">http:\/\/www.queenmary.com\/index.php?page=weddings<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/igtjtwm9c.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/igtjtwm9c.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"pinayqt96@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1227242133,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212801.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":281,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Pnay_QT77","Id":212801,"Name":"Pnay_QT77","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"41fb4fe7cb1dcdf221e2bd7124cb0e8c","RawContent":"great cake pics on here! i am getting so many ideas for our wedding cake. thanks , ladies!","Attachments":[],"Id":517509,"PostDate":1227515351,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                great cake pics on here! i am getting so many ideas for our wedding cake. thanks , ladies!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shaza