              <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                greaaaattt cakes! Well I am at the stage where I am looking for cakes to send to my wc..... i found some really nice ones but do not know if it will be doable.... does anyone have pictures of cakes done at Majestic??\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tac.families.com\/ezb\/1171692.png\">http:\/\/tac.families.com\/ezb\/1171692.png<\/a><br><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tac.families.com\/ezb\/1171691.png\">http:\/\/tac.families.com\/ezb\/1171691.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cmk22@optonline.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1224522609,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212343.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Christinamaria22","Id":212343,"Name":"Christinamaria22","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fa7c81e43ae57b3b61d27569a2e10a32","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;EricaG&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;What does your wedding cake look like? Post pics of your cake(s), or pics of the cake you would like to have at your DW &amp;amp;\/or AHR. \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i141.photobucket.com\/albums\/r51\/ethrondson\/Jan2020062008120whitened20and20crop.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n Here is the cake that I want for my AHR. I will be changing it slightly, as it will be white and teal, and the solid white will be at the bottom and the solid teal will be at the top. My Mom has made several wedding cakes, and this time I want to make it with her assistance! Not really sure what is happening with the DW cake yet!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;That is sooo cute!!","Attachments":[],"Id":550384,"PostDate":1231222348,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>EricaG<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">What does your wedding cake look like? Post pics of your cake(s), or pics of the cake you would like to have at your DW &\/or AHR. <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i141.photobucket.com\/albums\/r51\/ethrondson\/Jan2020062008120whitened20and20crop.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> Here is the cake that I want for my AHR. I will be changing it slightly, as it will be white and teal, and the solid white will be at the bottom and the solid teal will be at the top. My Mom has made several wedding cakes, and this time I want to make it with her assistance! Not really sure what is happening with the DW cake yet!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>That is sooo cute!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"beebumble27@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1199942657,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208188.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"beebumble27","Id":208188,"Name":"beebumble27","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":880,"TotalPages":88,"CurrentPage":70,"NextPage":80,"PreviousPage":60,"LastPage":870},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
