"custom"},"FormattedName":"MsShelley","Id":207447,"Name":"MsShelley","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3a01a3dd0b4b77d794936e738f660d0a","RawContent":"Beautiful cakes they look really yummy.","Attachments":[],"Id":556192,"PostDate":1231610497,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Beautiful cakes they look really yummy.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"law_mack2009@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1220906679,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211643.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"42010bride","Id":211643,"Name":"42010bride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ff7c7cd2d4f33891cd44318dbde8a3e2","RawContent":"I posted before our wedding but here is the picture I sent to our wedding coordinator which she said would be no problem to create for us.....\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i283.photobucket.com\/albums\/kk296\/geminilibra_2008\/bamboocake.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n And here is the actual cake ......&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i283.photobucket.com\/albums\/kk296\/geminilibra_2008\/DSC03785.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n The ONLY regret I have is paying for this cake, I actually laughed at it when they brought it out for us. It is so ugly. It tasted good but come on now, they don&#039;t even look alike. And, they used fake orchids on it!!","Attachments":[],"Id":560092,"PostDate":1231892310,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I posted before our wedding but here is the picture I sent to our wedding coordinator which she said would be no problem to create for us.....<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i283.photobucket.com\/albums\/kk296\/geminilibra_2008\/bamboocake.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> And here is the actual cake ......<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i283.photobucket.com\/albums\/kk296\/geminilibra_2008\/DSC03785.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> The ONLY regret I have is paying for this cake, I actually laughed at it when they brought it out for us. It is so ugly. It tasted good but come on now, they don't even look alike. And, they used fake orchids on it!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kleigh153@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1192406846,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"GeminiLibra","Id":207846,"Name":"GeminiLibra","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0bdc0756541890c1b350063bab9477e0","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;GeminiLibra&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I posted before our wedding but here is the picture I sent to our wedding coordinator which she said would be no problem to create for us.....\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i283.photobucket.com\/albums\/kk296\/geminilibra_2008\/bamboocake.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n And here is the actual cake ......&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i283.photobucket.com\/albums\/kk296\/geminilibra_2008\/DSC03785.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n The ONLY regret I have is paying for this cake, I actually laughed at it when they brought it out for us. It is so ugly. It tasted good but come on now, they don&#039;t even look alike. And, they used fake orchids on it!!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;LOL! I swear that I&#039;m not trying to be mean but I totally loved your vision and inspiration for the cake...I was really excited to see your actual cake. You&#039;re right, they don&#039;t look anything alike and the fake green orchids aren&#039;t exactly the best I&#039;ve ever seen. &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; Did many people end up eating your cake? I think I might still give them an A effort. :)","Attachments":[],"Id":586066,"PostDate":1234067148,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>GeminiLibra<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I posted before our wedding but here is the picture I sent to our wedding coordinator which she said would be no problem to create for us.....<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i283.photobucket.com\/albums\/kk296\/geminilibra_2008\/bamboocake.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> And here is the actual cake ......<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i283.photobucket.com\/albums\/kk296\/geminilibra_2008\/DSC03785.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> The ONLY regret I have is paying for this cake, I actually laughed at it when they brought it out for us. It is so ugly. It tasted good but come on now, they don't even look alike. And, they used fake orchids on it!!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>LOL! I swear that I'm not trying to be mean but I totally loved your vision and inspiration for the cake...I was really excited to see your actual cake. You're right, they don't look anything alike and the fake green orchids aren't exactly the best I've ever seen. <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> Did many people end up eating your cake? I think I might still give them an A effort. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"gasper.kj@gmail.com","IpAddress":"76.92.164.52","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1214882000,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210256.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kits55","Id":210256,"Name":"Kits55","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e377cb2abf4add9d7cc8cbdf210ad7ad","RawContent":"First off, this is the worst thread to find when you\u00e2\u20ac\u2122re trying to be good on your diet. Hehehe, but I LOVE IT!!! These cakes are all so beautiful &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/rolleyes.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Roll Eyes\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n We are planning on having a small cake at the top of our cupcake tower so we\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ll have something to cut. I think we will be something similar to this style ~ very simple, few flower accents with candles, which I think gives it a romantic elegance.\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i287.photobucket.com\/albums\/ll150\/msam007562\/P6120081.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n So with a small cake at the top of the tower, the bottom layers will be all cupcakes \u00e2\u20ac\u201csimilar to this, but decorated with flowers that will be in theme with our own colors \u00e2\u20ac\u201c terracotta, canary yellow, latte brown, red, and ivory!\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i287.photobucket.com\/albums\/ll150\/msam007562\/cupcaketree.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":586733,"PostDate":1234156485,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                First off, this is the worst thread to find when you\u00e2\u20ac\u2122re trying to be good on your diet. Hehehe, but I LOVE IT!!! These cakes are all so beautiful <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/rolleyes.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Roll Eyes\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> We are planning on having a small cake at the top of our cupcake tower so we\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ll have something to cut. I think we will be something similar to this style ~ very simple, few flower accents with candles, which I think gives it a romantic elegance.<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i287.photobucket.com\/albums\/ll150\/msam007562\/P6120081.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> So with a small cake at the top of the tower, the bottom layers will be all cupcakes \u00e2\u20ac\u201csimilar to this, but decorated with flowers that will be in theme with our own colors \u00e2\u20ac\u201c terracotta, canary yellow, latte brown, red, and ivory!<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i287.photobucket.com\/albums\/ll150\/msam007562\/cupcaketree.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"msam007562@aol.com","IpAddress":"108.185.45.53","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1205815380,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208840.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":97,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MarieSam","Id":208840,"Name":"MarieSam","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f6685c3ac6ee5c6be70d6661becaeda6","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;GeminiLibra&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I posted before our wedding but here is the picture I sent to our wedding coordinator which she said would be no problem to create for us.....\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i283.photobucket.com\/albums\/kk296\/geminilibra_2008\/bamboocake.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n And here is the actual cake ......&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i283.photobucket.com\/albums\/kk296\/geminilibra_2008\/DSC03785.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n The ONLY regret I have is paying for this cake, I actually laughed at it when they brought it out for us. It is so ugly. It tasted good but come on now, they don&#039;t even look alike. And, they used fake orchids on it!!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I have to say when I saw your posting of the inspiration cake I wanted to steal the idea, but after seeing what the finished product was, I think I am leaning more towards a traditional design. When scrolling the picture I laughed out loud, but I guarantee that is a cake you will never forget. Knowing myself and my FI we would have loved that as it would have really taken the edge off the whole wedding hype. Weddings should be happy and fun and I can only imagine when the cake was presented, all guests at your wedding were in awe. It would have been great to have a snapshot of what the cake was supposed to look like sitting next to the cake you paid for. They definitely tried, but I hope they think twice the next time they say, &amp;quot;not a problem.&amp;quot; Thanks for the posting.","Attachments":[],"Id":589044,"PostDate":1234336345,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>GeminiLibra<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I posted before our wedding but here is the picture I sent to our wedding coordinator which she said would be no problem to create for us.....<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i283.photobucket.com\/albums\/kk296\/geminilibra_2008\/bamboocake.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> And here is the actual cake ......<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i283.photobucket.com\/albums\/kk296\/geminilibra_2008\/DSC03785.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> The ONLY regret I have is paying for this cake, I actually laughed at it when they brought it out for us. It is so ugly. It tasted good but come on now, they don't even look alike. And, they used fake orchids on it!!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I have to say when I saw your posting of the inspiration cake I wanted to steal the idea, but after seeing what the finished product was, I think I am leaning more towards a traditional design. When scrolling the picture I laughed out loud, but I guarantee that is a cake you will never forget. Knowing myself and my FI we would have loved that as it would have really taken the edge off the whole wedding hype. Weddings should be happy and fun and I can only imagine when the cake was presented, all guests at your wedding were in awe. It would have been great to have a snapshot of what the cake was supposed to look like sitting next to the cake you paid for. They definitely tried, but I hope they think twice the next time they say, \"not a problem.\" Thanks for the posting.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"antonandamanda@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1230706061,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213453.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"babymagic40","Id":213453,"Name":"babymagic40","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"55bc36524d9ce836a466f3e3e6de5956","RawContent":"I must say that most people ate the cake and really enjoyed it, we had two cakes and we also brought cake boxes so everyone was able to take cake back to their rooms and eat it. So at least it was tasty, but... it wasn&#039;t very pretty. It wasn&#039;t something I was angry about maybe a bit disappointed but really it&#039;s only cake so no biggie. Having a picture there would have been funny, but the resort tried and it was yummy and of course we were happy to be married on a beautiful island so can&#039;t complain too much!!","Attachments":[],"Id":596978,"PostDate":1235003291,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I must say that most people ate the cake and really enjoyed it, we had two cakes and we also brought cake boxes so everyone was able to take cake back to their rooms and eat it. So at least it was tasty, but... it wasn't very pretty. It wasn't something I was angry about maybe a bit disappointed but really it's only cake so no biggie. Having a picture there would have been funny, but the resort tried and it was yummy and of course we were happy to be married on a beautiful island so can't complain too much!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kleigh153@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1192406846,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"GeminiLibra","Id":207846,"Name":"GeminiLibra","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9b61203ec38037b06b825d481ad594b9","RawContent":"Here are the inspiration pics for my Vegas wedding. We will go with a combo of the two looks, in our colors.\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i83.photobucket.com\/albums\/j286\/caboweddingforum\/cake-original.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i83.photobucket.com\/albums\/j286\/caboweddingforum\/King_and_Queen.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":618358,"PostDate":1236849051,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here are the inspiration pics for my Vegas wedding. We will go with a combo of the two looks, in our colors.<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i83.photobucket.com\/albums\/j286\/caboweddingforum\/cake-original.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i83.photobucket.com\/albums\/j286\/caboweddingforum\/King_and_Queen.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kuroicat@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1232556273,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214166.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lolkitteh","Id":214166,"Name":"lolkitteh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f2c478bbfa0c0a89f38b1435a8c28436","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;lolkitteh&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Here are the inspiration pics for my Vegas wedding. We will go with a combo of the two looks, in our colors.\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i83.photobucket.com\/albums\/j286\/caboweddingforum\/cake-original.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i83.photobucket.com\/albums\/j286\/caboweddingforum\/King_and_Queen.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I absolutely LOVE your inspiration cakes ~ so fun and totally perfect for a Vegas wedding!! Can&#039;t wait to see how your cake turns out &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/rolleyes.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Roll Eyes\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":618362,"PostDate":1236850738,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>lolkitteh<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Here are the inspiration pics for my Vegas wedding. We will go with a combo of the two looks, in our colors.<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i83.photobucket.com\/albums\/j286\/caboweddingforum\/cake-original.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i83.photobucket.com\/albums\/j286\/caboweddingforum\/King_and_Queen.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I absolutely LOVE your inspiration cakes ~ so fun and totally perfect for a Vegas wedding!! Can't wait to see how your cake turns out <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/rolleyes.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Roll Eyes\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"msam007562@aol.com","IpAddress":"108.185.45.53","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1205815380,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208840.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":97,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MarieSam","Id":208840,"Name":"MarieSam","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"Total