e,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2e226b0788becb2497eb09f3520b3d3a","RawContent":"Sarafish,\n \n that cake is lovely! You must have had a great shower.","Attachments":[],"Id":643840,"PostDate":1239026531,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Sarafish,<br \/> <br \/> that cake is lovely! You must have had a great shower.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"KatieScarlett427@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238342511,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216262.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"EmeraldPalms","Id":216262,"Name":"EmeraldPalms","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c20eefeeac5b4157bcb480b5be145778","RawContent":"Thanks! We were going to save the top tier for our first anniversary but I&#039;m told it will get yucky and freezer-burnt if it&#039;s stuck in the freezer for a year! So we must eat it this week as we leave on the 13th for our wedding! Nothing like stuffing yourself with cake and then trying to get into a wedding dress LOL","Attachments":[],"Id":644020,"PostDate":1239033763,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks! We were going to save the top tier for our first anniversary but I'm told it will get yucky and freezer-burnt if it's stuck in the freezer for a year! So we must eat it this week as we leave on the 13th for our wedding! Nothing like stuffing yourself with cake and then trying to get into a wedding dress LOL\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sara.klassen@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1225215311,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212442.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sarafish81","Id":212442,"Name":"sarafish81","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"058915aa28f5d26a2ad8951c8ee69f93","RawContent":"So This is my drool cake from the begining\n \n &lt;img src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/i678.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv143\/graybeee\/cdsc.jpg?t=1239211891\"]http:\/\/i678.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv143\/graybeee\/cdsc.jpg?t=1239211891\"[\/url] border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n But these others are starting to ketch my eye\n \n &lt;img src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/i678.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv143\/graybeee\/spring-cake_300.jpg?t=1239211997\"]http:\/\/i678.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv143\/graybeee\/spring-cake_300.jpg?t=1239211997\"[\/url] border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/i678.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv143\/graybeee\/summer06_cakes5a.jpg?t=1239212026\"]http:\/\/i678.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv143\/graybeee\/summer06_cakes5a.jpg?t=1239212026\"[\/url] border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/i678.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv143\/graybeee\/win00_chrysanthemum3_xl.jpg?t=1239212056\"]http:\/\/i678.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv143\/graybeee\/win00_chrysanthemum3_xl.jpg?t=1239212056\"[\/url] border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/i678.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv143\/graybeee\/4-2-1.jpg\"]http:\/\/i678.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv143\/graybeee\/4-2-1.jpg\"[\/url] border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":646923,"PostDate":1239208572,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So This is my drool cake from the begining<br \/>\n <br \/>\n <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i678.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv143\/graybeee\/cdsc.jpg?t=1239211891\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/>\n <br \/>\n But these others are starting to ketch my eye<br \/>\n <br \/>\n <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i678.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv143\/graybeee\/spring-cake_300.jpg?t=1239211997\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/>\n <br \/>\n <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i678.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv143\/graybeee\/summer06_cakes5a.jpg?t=1239212026\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/>\n <br \/>\n <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i678.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv143\/graybeee\/win00_chrysanthemum3_xl.jpg?t=1239212056\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/>\n <br \/>\n <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i678.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv143\/graybeee\/4-2-1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Jillandtimswedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1235353260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215165.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Adlergray","Id":215165,"Name":"Adlergray","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8913d83c25bf45e5c0990c7b07128d03","RawContent":"Wow. These cakes are amazing! I was hungry...now I am starving! And it is much too late for me to eat anything. (I have a certain dress to fit into in a few months!) :)","Attachments":[],"Id":650168,"PostDate":1239446820,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Wow. These cakes are amazing! I was hungry...now I am starving! And it is much too late for me to eat anything. (I have a certain dress to fit into in a few months!) <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;405\/st\/20090822\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-3\/k\/744d\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...744d\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"purrfected@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1231526995,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213771.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"purrfected","Id":213771,"Name":"purrfected","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a9dd1aed6816cab0c653feeaa0c55130","RawContent":"Okay... this is just an inspiration picture, my FI and I will be designing the cake together and he will be creating it, he is a graphic designer by trade but started doing cakes and is great at it!! Anyway, the cake will be something like this, in our colors, orange and green, and instead of the flowers, there will be homemade chocolate and white chocolate seashells. This is for our AHR, I am just getting something simple and basic at the resort.\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i425.photobucket.com\/albums\/pp339\/twinkle320\/cakeinspiration.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":652375,"PostDate":1239648798,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Okay... this is just an inspiration picture, my FI and I will be designing the cake together and he will be creating it, he is a graphic designer by trade but started doing cakes and is great at it!! Anyway, the cake will be something like this, in our colors, orange and green, and instead of the flowers, there will be homemade chocolate and white chocolate seashells. This is for our AHR, I am just getting something simple and basic at the resort.<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i425.photobucket.com\/albums\/pp339\/twinkle320\/cakeinspiration.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i425.photobucket.com\/albums\/pp339\/twinkle320\/pro4-1-1-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i425.photobucket.com\/albums\/p...pro4-1-1-1.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"twinkle320@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1216129839,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210550.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"~*~Margie~*~","Id":210550,"Name":"~*~Margie~*~","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6f5003e9d95bc0203098e361a4739d2a","RawContent":"Here&#039;s the photo from the baker -- only ours will be round.\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i-do-cakes.com\/imgs\/bride_001_lg.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n The best part -- the cake is absolutely delicious. We went down for a cake tasting last fall and loved every bite of the small cake she gave us as a sample. Yum....","Attachments":[],"Id":652404,"PostDate":1239650141,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here's the photo from the baker -- only ours will be round.<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i-do-cakes.com\/imgs\/bride_001_lg.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> The best part -- the cake is absolutely delicious. We went down for a cake tasting last fall and loved every bite of the small cake she gave us as a sample. Yum....\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"meghan_higgins@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1211468081,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209538.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"meghan1177","Id":209538,"Name":"meghan1177","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cd00dcb0a152c214d9c86f78d7b1d3f9","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Adlergray&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i678.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv143\/graybeee\/4-2-1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I have this exact photo cut out from a magazine and in my wedding planning binder! I love it&#039;s simplicity but then it has the detail with the flowers.","Attachments":[],"Id":652405,"PostDate":1239650144,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n   