673,"PostDate":1239923906,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                i love all these cakes! there are so many beautiful ones to choose from! are these for your AHR or also for the DW?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i>Angela & Chris<\/i><\/div><\/div>","Email":"angelrtrev@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1236957554,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215774.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"angruck","Id":215774,"Name":"angruck","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b66e21d18b50bf70cfcd2ff7519e8836","RawContent":"foxy bride-awsome cake..so pretty","Attachments":[],"Id":658740,"PostDate":1240003368,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                foxy bride-awsome cake..so pretty\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/107\/224\/20090720\/We+get+Married%21%21\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/107\/2...%21\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"smilesnj17@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1234054997,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214720.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LAURENANDBILL","Id":214720,"Name":"LAURENANDBILL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5b277e7078fb072c88ab3e9c1a2c1656","RawContent":"This thread is too much, I got the munchies real bad now... &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile78.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile78\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n Some fab inspiration here girls. Im just having a small simple cake as we only have to feed 13 including me and FI but I really want it to taste good. Thinking of going with Baileys flavour, I&#039;ll bring a bottle from duty free cos I dont think they&#039;ll have any in Tulum?\n \n I have a friend who&#039;s a chef and he&#039;s gonna come up with the recipie and make me some trial tasters but my question is this, is it rude to present the chefs at my hotel with a recipie? I really want it to be good but dont wanna P**s them off by suggesting they dont know how to make cake... etiquette experts some advice please!","Attachments":[],"Id":664383,"PostDate":1240425007,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This thread is too much, I got the munchies real bad now... <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile78.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile78\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Some fab inspiration here girls. Im just having a small simple cake as we only have to feed 13 including me and FI but I really want it to taste good. Thinking of going with Baileys flavour, I'll bring a bottle from duty free cos I dont think they'll have any in Tulum?<br \/> <br \/> I have a friend who's a chef and he's gonna come up with the recipie and make me some trial tasters but my question is this, is it rude to present the chefs at my hotel with a recipie? I really want it to be good but dont wanna P**s them off by suggesting they dont know how to make cake... etiquette experts some advice please!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i>Michelle X<\/i><br><br><span>PLANNING THREAD:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f128\/northernflashers-better-late-than-never-planning-thread-58694\/\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...-thread-58694\/<\/a><span>DREAMS TULUM REVIEW: MARCH 2010:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/northernflashers-dre