Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d488768d0fa89e4245be70766385d114","RawContent":"Natalia, your thinking is like mine too. I know that I&#039;m putting flowers on my cake and having an initial monogram on top, but other than that, I was just going with the resort cake and not worrying about it (even though I heard many times dreams PV doesn&#039;t have good deserts - oh well) - it&#039;s funny and interesting to see what things certain brides are worried about and what things they aren&#039;t....","Attachments":[],"Id":761398,"PostDate":1247696667,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Natalia, your thinking is like mine too. I know that I'm putting flowers on my cake and having an initial monogram on top, but other than that, I was just going with the resort cake and not worrying about it (even though I heard many times dreams PV doesn't have good deserts - oh well) - it's funny and interesting to see what things certain brides are worried about and what things they aren't....\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>~jill~<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20091204\/e\/til%27+I+be