                 width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Such beautiful cakes!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Dee<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/ticker.7910.org\/as1cHkZ0g410500Nzc3NzJvfDAwMDM0NG98SSBtYXJyeSBteSBiZXN0IGZyaWVuZCBpbiA.gif\">http:\/\/ticker.7910.org\/as1cHkZ0g4105...WVuZCBpbiA.gif<\/a><br><span>_____________________________________________<\/span><br><strong>September Siggy Challenge<\/strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i103.photobucket.com\/albums\/m160\/friendoftoto\/JollyJericho.jpg\">http:\/\/i103.photobucket.com\/albums\/m...llyJericho.jpg<\/a><strong>OYE! My head! Man, we really need to lay off the catnip!<\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"friendoftoto@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1250879843,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220811.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrsgtobe","Id":220811,"Name":"mrsgtobe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e436879307a0ac545e13e45bcf03edb4","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;lrfriendly&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I love the cakes with the shells on them. Do they melt in the sun??&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;My shells didn&#039;t melt, but they weren&#039;t chocolate (like I was going to originally get). They were actually gumpaste (basically hard sugar). They maintained their shape, but are a bit delicate. I kept them in the box that they were shipped in and only had a few casualties. I had way more than enough shells (and cake for that matter)","Attachments":[],"Id":840567,"PostDate":1252701205,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>lrfriendly<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I love the cakes with the shells on them. Do they melt in the sun??<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>My shells didn't melt, but they weren't chocolate (like I was going to originally get). They were actually gumpaste (basically hard sugar). They maintained their shape, but are a bit delicate. I kept them in the box that they were shipped in and only had a few casualties. I had way more than enough shells (and cake for that matter)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/farm4.static.flickr.com\/3332\/3529916566_514876afde.jpg?v=0\">http:\/\/farm4.static.flickr.com\/3332\/...76afde.jpg?v=0<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20090509\/e\/I+marry+my+love%21%21%21\/k\/e0b1\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...e0b1\/event.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;128\/st\/20090726\/e\/Honeymoon+on+CCL+Legend\/k\/e348\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...e348\/event.png<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.flickr.com\/photos\/jimandjulieacuna\/sets\/\">http:\/\/www.flickr.com\/photos\/jimandjulieacuna\/sets\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"julie_gwyn_saltwell@vanguard.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1203951811,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208644.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"drbrainfreeze","Id":208644,"Name":"drbrainfreeze","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4d19799a2d7c7df28ae58c5d7eaf4aba","RawContent":"The cake for our actual wedding in Cuba was nothing special as we didn&#039;t ask for anything specific at all ...\n \n However, for the AHR we did something a bit different and decided to go with cupcakes so we didn&#039;t have to do a cutting of the cake or anything like that ... plus we knew that everyone loves cupcakes!! \n \n We used Clever Cupcakes in Montreal to do custom-designed cupcakes and chose the colors and flavours ... \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/img13.imageshack.us\/img13\/531\/ahr2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/img406.imageshack.us\/img406\/3256\/ahr3.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":840835,"PostDate":1252713568,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                The cake for our actual wedding in Cuba was nothing special as we didn't ask for anything specific at all ...<br \/> <br \/> However, for the AHR we did something a bit different and decided to go with cupcakes so we didn't have to do a cutting of the cake or anything like that ... plus we knew that everyone loves cupcakes!! <br \/> <br \/> We used Clever Cupcakes in Montreal to do custom-designed cupcakes and chose the colors and flavours ... <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/img13.imageshack.us\/img13\/531\/ahr2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/img406.imageshack.us\/img406\/3256\/ahr3.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i>Automotive Journalist Extraordinaire<\/i><br><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/drivingmsmiranda.wordpress.com\/\">Driving MsMiranda's Blog<\/a><\/strong><br><br><br><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f128\/blissfulmsmirandas-mirandas-planning-madness-pic-heavy-42210\/\">Miranda's Planning Thread ~~<\/a><\/strong><span> <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f55\/my-montreal-bd-shoot-pics-41285\/\">Miranda's BD Shoot<\/a><\/strong><span> <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f76\/mirandas-non-pro-melia-cayo-guillermo-wedding-ttd-pics-43309\/\">~~ Miranda's Non-Pro Pics ~~<\/a><\/strong><span> <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f76\/mirandas-cuba-melia-cayo-guillermo-pro-pic-teasers-alain-doss-photography-46525\/\">Miranda's Pro Pics ~~<\/a><\/strong><span> <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f76\/mirandas-pro-ttd-teaser-pics-alain-doss-photography-46528\/\">Miranda's Pro TTD Pics<\/a><\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"miranda.lightstone@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1214092002,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210089.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BlissfulMsMiranda","Id":210089,"Name":"BlissfulMsMiranda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"acc6f0d9f6bbf0cc6827bb80db33eac8","RawContent":"I already posted a few, but I&#039;m a big fan of inspiration so here are some more =