e the 2 flavors we&#039;re going with I just copied these from the bakery&#039;s website:\n Homemade Lemon Poppy Seed Layer Cake\n A light lemon poppy seed cake filled with fresh strawberries. We finish this cake with white chocolate butter cream\n Homemade Inside Out German Chocolate Cake\n An amazingly rich concoction of chocolate devil&#8217;s food cake spiked with espresso. We fill the center of this layer cake with toasted pecans, caramel and toasted coconut, and then finish it with bittersweet chocolate ganache.","Attachments":[],"Id":881855,"PostDate":1255393724,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey we have a 2 layer cake so these are the 2 flavors we're going with I just copied these from the bakery's website:<br \/> Homemade Lemon Poppy Seed Layer Cake<br \/> A light lemon poppy seed cake filled with fresh strawberries. We finish this cake with white chocolate butter cream<br \/> Homemade Inside Out German Chocolate Cake<br \/> An amazingly rich concoction of chocolate devil&#8217;s food cake spiked with espresso. We fill the center of this layer cake with toasted pecans, caramel and toasted coconut, and then finish it with bittersweet chocolate ganache.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i><strong>Be Blessed,<br>Mrs. Willis<br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/MrandMrsWillis.shutterfly.com\">MrandMrsWillis.shutterfly.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/ashleyandbri