dimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>This is so decadent. A chocolate lovers dream. I don't eat chocolate but this cake could change that. Nice.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aobassey@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1248787156,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219919.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"affiwin","Id":219919,"Name":"affiwin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1e8d489a755a18fe69e447c86db94e2b","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Jennyco116&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Cakes by Karol in Key West will be doing our cake. This is the cake that we want except the chocolate dripping on the sides will be hot pink and the strawberries will be orange colored white chocolate....\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i618.photobucket.com\/albums\/tt270\/jennyco116\/cake.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;WOW! looks so yummy","Attachments":[],"Id":893873,"PostDate":1256144246,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Jennyco116<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Cakes by Karol in Key West will be doing our cake. This is the cake that we want except the chocolate dripping on the sides will be hot pink and the strawberries will be orange colored white chocolate....<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i618.photobucket.com\/albums\/tt270\/jennyco116\/cake.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>WOW! looks so yummy\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/ticker.7910.org\/as1cHl10g410500NTQxNzJvfDQ1MjQzNWx8R2V0dGluZyBtYXJyaWVkISEh.gif\">http:\/\/ticker.7910.org\/as1cHl10g4105...JyaWVkISEh.gif<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sschuster@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1232139739,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214015.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":70,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sarah310","Id":214015,"Name":"sarah310","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a62acd050472dcacf63a654752d34669","RawContent":"Heres mine!\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i162.photobucket.com\/albums\/t244\/act1980\/Wedding\/1-white-orchid-wedding-cake.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n I figured the resort can&#039;t go wrong with making 3 plain square cakes &amp;amp; then just putting some orchids in the gaps! Was a bit worried about giving them something challenging just in case they screwed it up.\n \n Fingers crossed this should turn out like the pic! Wish me luck!! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":908882,"PostDate":1257198528,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Heres mine!<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i162.photobucket.com\/albums\/t244\/act1980\/Wedding\/1-white-orchid-wedding-cake.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> I figured the resort can't go wrong with making 3 plain square cakes & then just putting some orchids in the gaps! Was a bit worried about giving them something challenging just in case they screwed it up.<br \/> <br \/> Fingers crossed this should turn out like the pic! Wish me luck!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/Z1a8p1.png\">http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/Z1a8p1.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"actl.1980@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1250496946,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220624.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":213,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"angelalanahung","Id":220624,"Name":"angelalanahung","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9e8259f900934e591d230dd7e765b264","RawContent":"I don&#039;t think I posted mine yet - we are having one layer of tres leches and one of mocha. My dad kindly did the tasting when my parents were down there for vacation. \n \n we want this cake but...\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i804.photobucket.com\/albums\/yy330\/alkoch8\/kljlk.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n with these colors....\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i804.photobucket.com\/albums\/yy330\/alkoch8\/WeddingInspirationBoard.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n At first the chef didn&#039;t understand the red &amp;amp; orange colors and the tasting cakes were pink and yellow needless to say our wedding coordinator from the hotel was embarrassed and kept promising my parents that the cake will look how we want it to - I wish I had a pic it looked like a kids birthday cake! Oh well hope they do better for the wedding!","Attachments":[],"Id":909505,"PostDate":1257227997,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I don't think I posted mine yet - we are having one layer of tres leches and one of mocha. My dad kindly did the tasting when my parents were down there for vacation. <br \/> <br \/> we want this cake but...<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i804.photobucket.com\/albums\/yy330\/alkoch8\/kljlk.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> with these colors....<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i804.photobucket.com\/albums\/yy330\/alkoch8\/WeddingInspirationBoard.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> At first the chef didn't understand the red & orange colors and the tasting cakes were pink and yellow needless to say our wedding coordinator from the hotel was embarrassed and kept promising my parents that the cake will look how we want it to - I wish I had a pic it looked like a kids birthday cake! Oh well hope they do better for the wedding!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Annette.parrent@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1243988180,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218061.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"alkoch","Id":218061,"Name":"alkoch","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8cb4ab721f06bcffec4f0834863b5592","RawContent":"Thanks for posting all the beautiful cakes! This will be so helpful when I meet with my baker next weekend!!","Attachments":[],"Id":926135,"PostDate":1258263343,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for posting all the beautiful cakes! This will be so helpful when I meet with my baker next weekend!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Loving married life! <3<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ldhearne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1249409940,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220176.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"*Linds*","Id":220176,"Name":"*Linds*","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":880,"TotalPages":88,"CurrentPage":210,"NextPage":220,"PreviousPage":200,"LastPage":870},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
