{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.178.109.129","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79108,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8644f021a1d1439d72aa2a35e5ebb941","RawContent":"&lt;span style=\"font-size:13px;\"&gt;Very beautiful like new wedding gown I purchased on sale at davids bridal last year for close to $700, where can I go to sell it and recieve immediate payment, and what sort of options do I have? Im not a big fan of ebay because they take an unreasonable amount that you get, and there are a lot of fees associated. Any ideas? Thank you&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.adora.gr\/&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\"&gt;http:\/\/www.adora.gr\/&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.adora.gr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/5-Animal-Loving-Natural-Wedding-By-Jess-Petrie-600x400.jpg\" alt=\"5-Animal-Loving-Natural-Wedding-By-Jess-\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894184,"PostDate":1429849894,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                \n\t<span  style=\"font-size:13px\">Very beautiful like new wedding gown I purchased on sale at davids bridal last year for close to $700, where can I go to sell it and recieve immediate payment, and what sort of options do I have? Im not a big fan of ebay because they take an unreasonable amount that you get, and there are a lot of fees associated. Any ideas? Thank you\u00a0<\/span><strong><a href='http:\/\/www.adora.gr\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">http:\/\/www.adora.gr\/<\/span><\/a><\/strong>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.adora.gr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/5-Animal-Loving-Natural-Wedding-By-Jess-Petrie-600x400.jpg\" alt=\"5-Animal-Loving-Natural-Wedding-By-Jess-\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dinobravo02@gmail.com","IpAddress":"122.178.109.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1429849563,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"davidmillers","Id":282846,"Name":"davidmillers","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"114.121.164.128","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79108,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e124864d7c01796e42d76591e99f83ef","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;you can sell by social media (ex : instagram, path. or twitter) or you can sell by ebay, blibli or another website, or you can sell to the bridal. as i know, if you have common size, you can sell it to bridal.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895259,"PostDate":1430717598,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>you can sell by social media (ex : instagram, path. or twitter) or you can sell by ebay, blibli or another website, or you can sell to the bridal. as i know, if you have common size, you can sell it to bridal.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samwillow39@gmail.com","IpAddress":"114.121.164.128","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430650422,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"samwillow","Id":282964,"Name":"samwillow","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.183.138.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79108,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"15c67b4195c2a7c24f8bae9be7d2a253","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;you could try something like craig&#039;s list. I&#039;m guessing websites where they sell second hand dresses also charge some kind of consignment fee. You could check how much that is and check local consignment stores to see what is more convenient :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You could also post it here!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The good thing is that because David&#039;s Bridal gowns are so popular you&#039;re likely to sell it quickly. People can easily try the dress on in their local David&#039;s Bridal and buy yours for a bit less ;).&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895295,"PostDate":1430748514,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>you could try something like craig's list. I'm guessing websites where they sell second hand dresses also charge some kind of consignment fee. You could check how much that is and check local consignment stores to see what is more convenient <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You could also post it here!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The good thing is that because David's Bridal gowns are so popular you're likely to sell it quickly. People can easily try the dress on in their local David's Bridal and buy yours for a bit less <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":79108,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"be2c2ab77bd179dcb1b6f520100960df","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;There is also a site called preownedweddingdresses.com&amp;nbsp; I have no idea if they charge or what they charge but it&#039;s very popular. Might be worth a look.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895336,"PostDate":1430778757,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>There is also a site called preownedweddingdresses.com\u00a0 I have no idea if they charge or what they charge but it's very popular. Might be worth a look.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit"