ide and groom + 10 kids = 95 room nights.    Focused on planning without stressing.","Email":"bush.chanel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401288470,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TheBHolders","Id":278146,"Name":"TheBHolders","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.46.249.60","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79113,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"73386b694faf6179c0aa21687d6add90","RawContent":"[quote name=\"beachbum21\" post=\"1894248\" timestamp=\"1429898261\"]\n4 real-touch bridesmaid bouquets for sale\nOriginally created by Bloom Bridal \n \n$80 for all + shipping from Toronto (or pick-up in Toronto)\n \nThese were used once for my wedding &amp;amp; pictures, they travelled easily in my carry-on\nNo discolouration or sign of use, these are in excellent condition and have been kept wrapped in tissue and boxed.[\/quote]They look nice but How do they feel and look in real life?","Attachments":[],"Id":1895169,"PostDate":1430536386,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>beachbum21, on 24 April 2015 - 01:57 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>\n4 real-touch bridesmaid bouquets for sale<br>\nOriginally created by Bloom Bridal\u00a0<br>\n\u00a0<br>\n$80 for all + shipping from Toronto (or pick-up in Toronto)<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nThese were used once for my wedding & pictures, they travelled easily in my carry-on<br>\nNo discolouration or sign of use, these are in excellent condition and have been kept wrapped in tissue and boxed.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThey look nice but How do they feel and look in real life?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ivyvel23@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.46.249.60","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430391761,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Ivydulce2015","Id":282919,"Name":"Ivydulce2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.85.88","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79113,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5f4432284df179d17f0e6ce730bcb49c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"perianjay\" post=\"1894256\" timestamp=\"1429885400\"]\n&amp;amp;lt;p&amp;amp;gt;These are beautiful! I almost wish I didn&#039;t already purchase mine. :(&amp;amp;lt;\/p&amp;amp;gt;[\/quote]\nThese are sold but in case you are considering them, they feel like and look like real flowers :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1895292,"PostDate":1430747829,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n        