  'subject' => 'your resort',
  'messageContent' => 'Hi. I was wondering if you know anything about one of the sister resorts to yours, Platinum Yucatan Princess Resort. I know it has the stay at one and play at 3 but we really like that it\'s adults only and it solves our issue of double beds. The reviews seem to all be good and the food reviews are good as well. The price point is even better than Azul Fives that we\'re looking at. Just wondered if you have an opinion. It would be very much appreciated.

Thanks very much!
',
