Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"698ce932d5e042616163615ff33ab5d8","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1893288\" timestamp=\"1429154522\"]\nYour thread is great! Good start! I look forward to seeing it continue!\n\nI have family in Langley. My dad moved west from Ontario with my brother several years after my mom passed away so more than 30 years ago now. He started in Richmond, then on to New Westminster, Surrey and now Langley. He&#039;ll be 94 in May bless him lol My son went to Vancouver to work with the Olympics 5 years ago and phoned me after they ended and said he wasn&#039;t coming back and could I please send his stuff!! We went out for a quick visit right before I went back to work last fall after being in the hospital and really enjoyed it. My husband used to be out there a lot for business so took me to Steveston for dinner and to a place right downtown where the artists are. Can&#039;t remember the name now. Right on the water at the base of a bridge. Anyway, we also tried to get up Grouse Mountain but it was a really foggy day and we figured we wouldn&#039;t see anything so that&#039;s on the agenda for another visit sometime.\n\nHappy planning![\/quote]Granville island?\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1893293,"PostDate":1429140452,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 15 April 2015 - 11:22 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Your thread is great! Good start! I look forward to seeing it continue!<br><br>\nI have family in Langley. My dad moved west from Ontario with my brother several years after my mom passed away so more than 30 years ago now. He started in Richmond, then on to New Westminster, Surrey and now Langley. He'll be 94 in May bless him lol My son went to Vancouver to work with the Olympics 5 years ago and phoned me after they ended and said he wasn't coming back and could I please send his stuff!! We went out for a quick visit right before I went back to work last fall after being in the hospital and really enjoyed it. My husband used to be out there a lot for business so took me to Steveston for dinner and to a place right downtown where the artists are. Can't remember the name now. Right on the water at the base of a bridge. Anyway, we also tried to get up Grouse Mountain but it was a really foggy day and we figured we wouldn't see anything so that's on the agenda for another visit sometime.<br><br>\nHappy planning!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nGranville island?<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5832daab184007645b0e299fb2d60955","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1893293\" timestamp=\"1429154852\"]\nGranville island?\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]\nThat&#039;s what I was thinking too  :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1893294,"PostDate":1429140642,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 15 April 2015 - 11:27 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Granville island?<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>That's what I was thinking too\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417435045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"78f83f273bfc0e0b1ddbff1c097d5292","RawContent":"@[member=\"vancouverpetunia\"] I love your story! It&#039;s so cute that a destination wedding got the two of you together! And I love how you said thank you instead of yes, that&#039;s do Canadian of you  lol\n\n\nYou picked a great resort and it&#039;s great that your guests are so proactive with the deposits!","Attachments":[],"Id":1893297,"PostDate":1429141158,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281283\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281283-vancouverpetunia\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">vancouverpetunia<\/span><\/a> I love your story! It's so cute that a destination wedding got the two of you together! And I love how you said thank you instead of yes, that's do Canadian of you  lol<br><br>\nYou picked a great resort and it's great that your guests are so proactive with the deposits! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410084185,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.231.97.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":79068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b5061cd2734428acf6d5d97c9cf9f793","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1893293\" timestamp=\"1429154852\"]\nGranville island?\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]\nHa! Yep! That&#039;s it!! I loved it!! It was a gorgeous day and we sat outside on a huge deck and had a drink in the sun. It was great!","Attachments":[],"Id":1893300,"PostDate":1429141696,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 15 April 2015 - 11:27 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Granville island?<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ha! Yep! That's it!! I loved it!! It was a gorgeous day and we sat outside on a huge deck and had a drink in the sun. It was great!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"788d1b24faabd5ed6c57d059309949d5","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1893300\" timestamp=\"1429156096\"]\nHa! Yep! That&#039;s it!! I loved it!! It was a gorgeous day and we sat outside on a huge deck and had a drink in the sun. It was great![\/quote]\nThe deck had to be at Bridges - a big yellow warehouse\/barn looking restaurant &amp;amp; pub. I don&#039;t love the restaurant (it&#039;s okay), but it&#039;s probably the best deck in the city. Vancouver is sadly lacking in them.","Attachments":[],"Id":1893302,"PostDate":1429142114,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 15 April 2015 - 11:48 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Ha! Yep! That's it!! I loved it!! It was a gorgeous day and we sat outside on a huge deck and had a drink in the sun. It was great!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The deck had to be at Bridges - a big yellow warehouse\/barn looking restaurant & pub. I don't love the restaurant (it's okay), but it's probably the best deck in the city. Vancouver is sadly lacking in them.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417435045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"461bf31c1dbccf4b56ec678e272bdbdf","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Wafflesmom\" post=\"1893297\" timestamp=\"1429155558\"]\n@[member=\"vancouverpetunia\"] I love your story! It&#039;s so cute that a destination wedding got the two of you together! And I love how you said thank you instead of yes, that&#039;s do Canadian of you lol\n\nYou picked a great resort and it&#039;s great that your guests are so proactive with the deposits![\/quote]\nHaha! Maybe I should have said sorry?  ;)","Attachments":[],"Id":1893306,"PostDate":1429145180,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Wafflesmom, on 15 April 2015 - 11:39 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281283\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281283-vancouverpetunia\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">vancouverpetunia<\/span><\/a> I love your story! It's so cute that a destination wedding got the two of you together! And I love how you said thank you instead of yes, that's do Canadian of you lol<br><br>\nYou picked a great resort and it's great that your guests are so proactive with the deposits!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Haha! Maybe I should have said sorry?\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417435045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"453c26146702255b028bf356543e3d1d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Yay! I love planning threads so much!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;First of all, I actually love your story. It seems that it was just meant to be between both of you :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;He proposed in South of France?! So romantic! - haha silly guys putting their rings in their wallets in places that are notorious for pick pocketing. Totally something my FI would do as well!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have to agree with you when it came to picking a resort.. it seemed to be one of the biggest hurdles. There are so many options and I have a hard time picking a resort to visit for a regular vacation, but then factoring in a wedding and being considerate and concious with price because you have a guest list.. it&#039;s definitely hard.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Glad to see you found your resort!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We got about half of our deposits in the first two months and then there was a bit of&amp;nbsp;a lull when no one was putting down deposits.. We got the last half of the deposits in the last week. It drove me bananas.. if you read any of my posts on here during that time frame I was basically a stressed out mess over it. It turned out fine though and all of my worries and stress were for nothing. 90% of the people that we invited RSVP&#039;d&amp;nbsp;yes\/put their deposit down&amp;nbsp;and we have a total of 32.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Can&#039;t wait to see your plans come along! It goes by really fast. It actually feels like yesterday when Chester and I decided on the resort and now we&#039;re 8 months away and time is flying by.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893317,"PostDate":1429174898,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Yay! I love planning threads so much!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>First of all, I actually love your story. It seems that it was just meant to be between both of you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>He proposed in South of France?! So romantic! - haha silly guys putting their rings in their wallets in places that are notorious for pick pocketing. Totally something my FI would do as well!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have to agree with you when it came to picking a resort.. it seemed to be one of the biggest hurdles. There are so many options and I have a hard time picking a resort to visit for a regular vacation, but then factoring in a wedding and being considerate and concious with price because you have a guest list.. it's definitely hard.<\/p>\n<p>Glad to see you found your resort!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We got about half of our deposits in the first two months and then there was a bit of\u00a0a lull when no one was putting down deposits.. We got the last half of the deposits in the last week. It drove me bananas.. if you read any of my posts on here during that time frame I was basically a stressed out mess over it. It turned out fine though and all of my worries and stress were for nothing. 90% of the people that we invited RSVP'd\u00a0yes\/put their deposit down\u00a0and we have a total of 32.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Can't wait to see your plans come along! It goes by really fast. It actually feels like yesterday when Chester and I decided on the resort and now we're 8 months away and time is flying by.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1419423414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.48.47.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"616d2d27368119c899cd92346d4f86e5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"vancouverpetunia\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Woohoo another planning thread to follow! I love seeing other peoples ideas. The story how you met is so cute!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Most people won&#039;t book til the last day...and sometimes you will get just a handful more who book after that so don&#039;t worry.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Cant wait to see some of your ideas :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893341,"PostDate":1429184333,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281283\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281283-vancouverpetunia\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">vancouverpetunia<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Woohoo another planning thread to follow! I love seeing other peoples ideas. The story how you met is so cute!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Most people won't book til the last day...and sometimes you will get just a handful more who book after that so don't worry.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Cant wait to see some of your ideas <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/'>My Planning Thread<\/a>\u00a0- MeandHim - Grand Palladium Bavaro - Nov 25 2015<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;116\/st\/20151125\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/461e\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"markandshavonne@live.com","IpAddress":"70.30.85.211","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1365777659,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Meandhim","Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.118.50.250","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"847d3b73f08a06209d563c3ae6f97815","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;@&lt;a  class=\"bbc_member\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281283-vancouverpetunia\/\" title=\"\"&gt;vancouverpetunia&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Yay, another planning thread! My wedding date is two days after yours, so if you&#039;re a big planner I&#039;ll be following along to make sure my planning is on track!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;The deposits for my group are due at the end of May and so far the only people that have booked are my parents, lol. I&#039;m sending out a reminder email tonight to get people&#039;s butts in gear before I die of stress.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893423,"PostDate":1429216639,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">@<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281283-vancouverpetunia\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>vancouverpetunia<\/a><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Yay, another planning thread! My wedding date is two days after yours, so if you're a big planner I'll be following along to make sure my planning is on track!<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">The deposits for my group are due at the end of May and so far the only people that have booked are my parents, lol. I'm sending out a reminder email tonight to get people's butts in gear before I die of stress.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;6\/st\/20160409\/e\/our+Wedding+Day\/k\/a16a\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n","Email":"krystalball@gmail.com","IpAddress":"158.82.202.5","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421849763,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281820.jpg?_r=1429976010","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"krystalball","Id":281820,"Name":"krystalball","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1429219891,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"a9fe2a4863bb0ccc3183734b0c76453f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;Site Visit&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\"&gt;We booked a rather last minute trip to the Riviera Maya (4 weeks in advance) for the first week of April 2015. We had zero intentions of going to the area before our wedding, but we were looking for a getaway and it wasn\u2019t much more expensive to do this than it was to go to Vegas for 3 days. And voila, it meant that I would get to do a site visit. :D&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;We visited Now Sapphire 1 year and 1 day before our wedding.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80985]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\"&gt;We arranged a meeting with our WC for a tour of the property and a menu tasting. Our WC is awesome. Juan Carlos has loads of wedding-related experience, including many years in the US, where he went to photography school, worked as a sous chef, did events for a caterer and eventually was a private wedding coordinator. I\u2019ve also found that he is very responsive, even though our wedding is a year away. I usually hear back from him within 2 - 4 days, which seems record fast compared to some of the discussions I see in these forums.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\"&gt;Unfortunately, I started to come down with the flu the day after we arrived in Mexico and by the time of our site visit (the day before we were to leave), the flu had turned into bronchitis. Pretty much my worst vacation ever. I was not feeling well for our site visit. I tried all of the food, but sometimes I could only manage a bite and felt nauseous off &amp;amp; on. It sucked. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt; :(&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\"&gt;But the resort did not! The food was delicious (despite my issues at the time). I wrote a post about the menu tasting here: &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/62152-now-sapphire-weddings-formerly-paradisus-riviera\/?p=1892795&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(17,85,204);background-color:transparent;\"&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/62152-now-sapphire-weddings-formerly-paradisus-riviera\/?p=1892795&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\"&gt;I loved the grounds, the rooms, the Preferred Pool, the beach. I freaked out a little bit about the main pool. It was smaller than I expected and it was ridiculously loud when we were there, with no escape from the craziness. They were having a foam party with a DJ. We&#039;re not college kids. Other than children, our youngest guest is about 26-27. Most people are 35 - 50 (FH is mid 30s and I\u2019m early 40s). I just couldn\u2019t imagine my parents or my 80 year old aunt and uncle enjoying this (and it\u2019s not my thing either)! :huh:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80984]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80983]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\"&gt;I\u2019ve been told this is not a regular occurrence and that they were doing it over spring break. Fingers crossed that is the case. However, it prompted me to look into upgrading to the Preferred Club. It\u2019s about $100 extra per person for the week and gets you access to a very lovely (and quiet!) adults-only pool, as well as other upgraded amenities. We were able to switch 6 of our 20 rooms in the block to Preferred. I am hoping we can grab more as other room blocks are released, as I think many of our guests would splurge for this. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\"&gt;Some other pix &amp;amp; comments about our site visit in this post: &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(17,85,204);background-color:transparent;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/62152-now-sapphire-weddings-formerly-paradisus-riviera\/?p=1892970&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/62152-now-sapphire-weddings-formerly-paradisus-riviera\/?p=1892970&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893432,"PostDate":1429219804,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span><span  style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;background-color:transparent\">Site Visit<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span><span  style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">We booked a rather last minute trip to the Riviera Maya (4 weeks in advance) for the first week of April 2015. We had zero intentions of going to the area before our wedding, but we were looking for a getaway and it wasn\u2019t much more expensive to do this than it was to go to Vegas for 3 days. And voila, it meant that I would get to do a site visit. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;background-color:transparent\">\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;background-color:transparent\">We visited Now Sapphire 1 year and 1 day before our wedding.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80985-1-year-1-day-to-go\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18009\/sml_gallery_281283_18009_220624.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='1 Year & 1 Day To Go!'  width='200' height='200'  alt='1 Year & 1 Day To Go!' id='sml_image_view_80985' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span><span  style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">We arranged a meeting with our WC for a tour of the property and a menu tasting. Our WC is awesome. Juan Carlos has loads of wedding-related experience, including many years in the US, where he went to photography school, worked as a sous chef, did events for a caterer and eventually was a private wedding coordinator. I\u2019ve also found that he is very responsive, even though our wedding is a year away. I usually hear back from him within 2 - 4 days, which seems record fast compared to some of the discussions I see in these forums.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span><span  style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">Unfortunately, I started to come down with the flu the day after we arrived in Mexico and by the time of our site visit (the day before we were to leave), the flu had turned into bronchitis. Pretty much my worst vacation ever. I was not feeling well for our site visit. I tried all of the food, but sometimes I could only manage a bite and felt nauseous off & on. It sucked. <\/span><\/span> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span><span  style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">But the resort did not! The food was delicious (despite my issues at the time). I wrote a post about the menu tasting here: <\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/62152-now-sapphire-weddings-formerly-paradisus-riviera\/?p=1892795' class='bbc_url' title=''><span  style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(17,85,204);background-color:transparent\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/62152-now-sapphire-weddings-formerly-paradisus-riviera\/?p=1892795<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span><span  style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">I loved the grounds, the rooms, the Preferred Pool, the beach. I freaked out a little bit about the main pool. It was smaller than I expected and it was ridiculously loud when we were there, with no escape from the craziness. They were having a foam party with a DJ. We're not college kids. Other than children, our youngest guest is about 26-27. Most people are 35 - 50 (FH is mid 30s and I\u2019m early 40s). I just couldn\u2019t imagine my parents or my 80 year old aunt and uncle enjoying this (and it\u2019s not my thing either)! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/huh.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':huh:' \/><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;background-color:transparent\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80984-main-pool-foam-party\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18009\/sml_gallery_281283_18009_1028488.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Main Pool Foam Party'  width='200' height='200'  alt='Main Pool Foam Party' id='sml_image_view_80984' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80983-main-pool-foam-party\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18009\/sml_gallery_281283_18009_301438.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Main Pool Foam Party'  width='200' height='150'  alt='Main Pool Foam Party' id='sml_image_view_80983' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span><span  style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">I\u2019ve been told this is not a regular occurrence and that they were doing it over spring break. Fingers crossed that is the case. However, it prompted me to look into upgrading to the Preferred Club. It\u2019s about $100 extra per person for the week and gets you access to a very lovely (and quiet!) adults-only pool, as well as other upgraded amenities. We were able to switch 6 of our 20 rooms in the block to Preferred. I am hoping we can grab more as other room blocks are released, as I think many of our guests would splurge for this. <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span><span  style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">Some other pix & comments about our site visit in this post: <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span><span  style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(17,85,204);background-color:transparent\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/62152-now-sapphire-weddings-formerly-paradisus-riviera\/?p=1892970' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...iera\/?p=1892970<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417435045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":35,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
