{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.18.168.1","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":5,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"89ee3c1941adcf0a1c4ccbd9481ef1c9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Received my first wedding-related online purchase today. YAY! Kimonos for me and my 2 BMs. Thanks&amp;nbsp;@[member=\"eriddell\"] for posting the La Vie en Rose sale. Great deal!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81089]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My FH has also ordered gifts for his GMs - he seemed inspired when I ordered the robes. I didn&#039;t see what he ordered, so hope it&#039;s not ridiculous&amp;nbsp; :P&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894002,"PostDate":1429733099,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Received my first wedding-related online purchase today. YAY! Kimonos for me and my 2 BMs. Thanks\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279216\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279216-eriddell\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">eriddell<\/span><\/a> for posting the La Vie en Rose sale. Great deal!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81089-bm-robes\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18009\/sml_gallery_281283_18009_195.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='BM robes'  width='163' height='200'  alt='BM robes' id='sml_image_view_81089' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My FH has also ordered gifts for his GMs - he seemed inspired when I ordered the robes. I didn't see what he ordered, so hope it's not ridiculous\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417435045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1429736429,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b379ca9e82ad8a64724c9a008810188a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\"&gt;Flowers&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\"&gt;I LOVE flowers, so this is one area I am somewhat willing to splurge. That said, I don\u2019t want to go too crazy. I do have some flowers included in my package, including: bridal bouquet, 2 corsages, 3 boutonnieres, and 1 centerpiece. I don\u2019t think I will use the corsages, but I can apply the value of them towards other elements.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\"&gt;I\u2019m considering peacock colors, although I&#039;m not looking to do a peacock theme. I\u2019m hoping to have a very tropical-looking bouquet, which often would mean warm colors like yellow, pink, orange, etc., but those were my sister\u2019s wedding colors and I don\u2019t really want to repeat them! Plus, my bridesmaids won\u2019t really look good in those colors. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\"&gt;So I was thinking blue and green orchids to achieve the tropical aspect, and then adding in some white and purple touches. I love calla lilies as well, so that would be nice. Something like these:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81090]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;(but no feathers)&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81091]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81092]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;(add more green)&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\"&gt;My other idea is to incorporate some citrus into the mix, specifically limes (and have a signature margarita to match!). So, possibly including some limes in the bouquets like this (ignore flowers\/colors):&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81093]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81094]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\"&gt;I\u2019d also like to use limes on the tables and on the cake, maybe combined with some individual vases with single stems to match the bouquets on the tables. Something along these lines:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81096]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81097]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81101]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81100]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81099]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81098]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81095]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\"&gt;All that said, I\u2019ve contacted my WC with my ideas, which he says he really likes, but has told me that the green orchids are \u201cpremium\u201d and will increase my costs and that blue orchids aren\u2019t available locally but they can paint white orchids blue. That might be an option, as some other brides have said they\u2019ve done it and it\u2019s fine, but I\u2019ve also asked the WC if the florist can provide some other suggestions for blue &amp;amp; green flowers that are naturally available and hopefully not at additional cost. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\"&gt;If anyone has any thoughts or suggestions, I would love to hear them!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894005,"PostDate":1429736317,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><strong><span><span  style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">Flowers<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span><span  style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">I LOVE flowers, so this is one area I am somewhat willing to splurge. That said, I don\u2019t want to go too crazy. I do have some flowers included in my package, including: bridal bouquet, 2 corsages, 3 boutonnieres, and 1 centerpiece. I don\u2019t think I will use the corsages, but I can apply the value of them towards other elements.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span><span  style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">I\u2019m considering peacock colors, although I'm not looking to do a peacock theme. I\u2019m hoping to have a very tropical-looking bouquet, which often would mean warm colors like yellow, pink, orange, etc., but those were my sister\u2019s wedding colors and I don\u2019t really want to repeat them! Plus, my bridesmaids won\u2019t really look good in those colors. <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span><span  style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">So I was thinking blue and green orchids to achieve the tropical aspect, and then adding in some white and purple touches. I love calla lilies as well, so that would be nice. Something like these:<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81090-bouquet-1\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18009\/sml_gallery_281283_18009_38557.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='bouquet 1'  width='125' height='200'  alt='bouquet 1' id='sml_image_view_81090' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>(but no feathers)<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81091-bouquet-2\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18009\/sml_gallery_281283_18009_22328.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='bouquet 2'  width='200' height='200'  alt='bouquet 2' id='sml_image_view_81091' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81092-bouquet-3\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18009\/sml_gallery_281283_18009_48729.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='bouquet 3'  width='136' height='200'  alt='bouquet 3' id='sml_image_view_81092' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>(add more green)<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p><span><span  style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">My other idea is to incorporate some citrus into the mix, specifically limes (and have a signature margarita to match!). So, possibly including some limes in the bouquets like this (ignore flowers\/colors):<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81093-bouquet-4-citrus\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18009\/sml_gallery_281283_18009_76688.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='bouquet 4 citrus'  width='200' height='134'  alt='bouquet 4 citrus' id='sml_image_view_81093' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81094-bouquet-5-citrus\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18009\/sml_gallery_281283_18009_14311.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='bouquet 5 citrus'  width='200' height='151'  alt='bouquet 5 citrus' id='sml_image_view_81094' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p><span><span  style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">I\u2019d also like to use limes on the tables and on the cake, maybe combined with some individual vases with single stems to match the bouquets on the tables. Something along these lines:<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81096-centerpiece-1\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18009\/sml_gallery_281283_18009_37119.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='centerpiece 1'  width='200' height='151'  alt='centerpiece 1' id='sml_image_view_81096' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81097-centerpiece-2\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18009\/sml_gallery_281283_18009_94133.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='centerpiece 2'  width='133' height='200'  alt='centerpiece 2' id='sml_image_view_81097' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81101-table-2\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18009\/sml_gallery_281283_18009_63964.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='table 2'  width='134' height='200'  alt='table 2' id='sml_image_view_81101' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81100-table-1\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18009\/sml_gallery_281283_18009_12473.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='table 1'  width='200' height='200'  alt='table 1' id='sml_image_view_81100' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81099-centerpiece-4\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18009\/sml_gallery_281283_18009_25581.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='centerpiece 4'  width='134' height='200'  alt='centerpiece 4' id='sml_image_view_81099' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81098-centerpiece-3\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18009\/sml_gallery_281283_18009_10081.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='centerpiece 3'  width='130' height='200'  alt='centerpiece 3' id='sml_image_view_81098' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81095-cake-1\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18009\/sml_gallery_281283_18009_222680.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='cake 1'  width='154' height='200'  alt='cake 1' id='sml_image_view_81095' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p><span><span  style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">All that said, I\u2019ve contacted my WC with my ideas, which he says he really likes, but has told me that the green orchids are \u201cpremium\u201d and will increase my costs and that blue orchids aren\u2019t available locally but they can paint white orchids blue. That might be an option, as some other brides have said they\u2019ve done it and it\u2019s fine, but I\u2019ve also asked the WC if the florist can provide some other suggestions for blue & green flowers that are naturally available and hopefully not at additional cost. <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span><span  style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">If anyone has any thoughts or suggestions, I would love to hear them!<\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417435045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.48.47.79","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e836b11bf9193de24dafc1195e5a8aa9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have a lot of blue in my decor as well but I&#039;m using a softer blue. I&#039;m using light blue delphiniums which I know are available locally in Mexico as they were not an extra cost to my bouquet. They come in a variety of blues with some more vibrant than others. They might be an option.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894010,"PostDate":1429741455,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have a lot of blue in my decor as well but I'm using a softer blue. I'm using light blue delphiniums which I know are available locally in Mexico as they were not an extra cost to my bouquet. They come in a variety of blues with some more vibrant than others. They might be an option.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1894010]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-281055-0-02128400-1429755826.jpg\" title=\"True_Blue_Delphinium_Flowers_300.jpg -  56.97KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-281055-0-02128400-1429755826.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"True_Blue_Delphinium_Flowers_300.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1894010]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-281055-0-69452500-1429755842.jpg\" title=\"blue delphinium.jpg -  14.89KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-281055-0-69452500-1429755842.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"blue delphinium.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;0\/st\/20160109\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/9fa9\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"sean.n.steph2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.12.52.42","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1415533111,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snswedding2016","Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fd847da4869a5b64ecbab7f222702fe1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"snswedding2016\"] Thank you! Delphiniums in a darker blue might do the trick!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894018,"PostDate":1429746963,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281055\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281055-snswedding2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">snswedding2016<\/span><\/a> Thank you! Delphiniums in a darker blue might do the trick!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417435045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cfa5c5cb779fb7579c4c9637d8df84cb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Haven&#039;t heard back from the WC\/florist yet, but did find a list of flowers that indicates what is available locally, general price point, etc. Not sure if it is accurate as it notes delphiniums as being \"$$$ pre-order 30 days, spring\/summer\" despite the post from @[member=\"snswedding2016\"]. But worth reviewing anyhow. I&#039;m adding it here so I don&#039;t lose it.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/21399-flowers-that-are-easiest-to-find-in-mexico\/?p=409012&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/21399-flowers-that-are-easiest-to-find-in-mexico\/?p=409012&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;$Good availability&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Gladiolas&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Nardos\/Tuberose&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Margarite Daisies&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Carnations&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Mini Carnations&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Star of Bethlehem&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Agapanthus (spring only)&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Spider mums&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Button mums&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Bougainvillea&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;$$Can be Seasonal&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Liatris&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Casa Blanca Lillies&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Gerber Daises&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Roses&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Bird o Paradise&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Hawaiian Ginger (red and pink)&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Freesia&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Lisianthus&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Snapdragons&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Larkspur&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Alstromeria&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Iris&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Oriental Lillies&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Stargazer Lily&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Cala Lily&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Mini Cala Lily&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;$$$ Pre-order 30 days&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Dendrobium Orchid&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Cattleyas Orchid&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Phalaenopsis Orchid&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Cymbidium Orchid&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;$$$ Pre-order 30 days&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Acapulco Lily&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Delphinium Spring\/Summer&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Antherium&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Heliconia&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Tulips**&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;$$ Pre-order 30 days&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Cala Lily&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Filler Flowers&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Solidalgo yellow&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Babies Breath&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Queen Anne&#039;s Lace seasonal&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Caspia\/limonium&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Stattice assorted colors&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Monte Casino small daisy like&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;in white and lavander&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Greens&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Palm&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Tree Fern&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Bear Grass&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Ming Fern&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Tropical&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Myrthe&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Eucalyptus&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Asparagus Fern&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Camilla&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Pittosporum&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Not Available&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Peonies&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Hydrangeas&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Stephanotis&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Lily of the Valley&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Oncydium Orchids&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;**Not Recommended**&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Tulips&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Gardenias per bag&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894333,"PostDate":1429913390,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Haven't heard back from the WC\/florist yet, but did find a list of flowers that indicates what is available locally, general price point, etc. Not sure if it is accurate as it notes delphiniums as being \"$$$ pre-order 30 days, spring\/summer\" despite the post from @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281055\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281055-snswedding2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">snswedding2016<\/span><\/a>. But worth reviewing anyhow. I'm adding it here so I don't lose it.<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/21399-flowers-that-are-easiest-to-find-in-mexico\/?p=409012' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...exico\/?p=409012<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">$Good availability<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Gladiolas<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Nardos\/Tuberose<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Margarite Daisies<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Carnations<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Mini Carnations<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Star of Bethlehem<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Agapanthus (spring only)<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Spider mums<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Button mums<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Bougainvillea<\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">$$Can be Seasonal<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Liatris<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Casa Blanca Lillies<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Gerber Daises<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Roses<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Bird o Paradise<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Hawaiian Ginger (red and pink)<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Freesia<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Lisianthus<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Snapdragons<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Larkspur<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Alstromeria<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Iris<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Oriental Lillies<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Stargazer Lily<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Cala Lily<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Mini Cala Lily<\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">$$$ Pre-order 30 days<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Dendrobium Orchid\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Cattleyas Orchid\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Phalaenopsis Orchid\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Cymbidium Orchid\u00a0<\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">$$$ Pre-order 30 days<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Acapulco Lily\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Delphinium Spring\/Summer\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Antherium\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Heliconia\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Tulips**<\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">$$ Pre-order 30 days<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Cala Lily<\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Filler Flowers\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Solidalgo yellow<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Babies Breath<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Queen Anne's Lace seasonal<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Caspia\/limonium\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Stattice assorted colors<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Monte Casino small daisy like<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">in white and lavander<\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Greens<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Palm<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Tree Fern\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Bear Grass\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Ming Fern\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Tropical<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Myrthe<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Eucalyptus<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Asparagus Fern\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Camilla<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Pittosporum<\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Not Available<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Peonies<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Hydrangeas<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Stephanotis<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Lily of the Valley\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Oncydium Orchids<\/span><br><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">**Not Recommended**<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Tulips<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Gardenias per bag<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417435045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.48.47.79","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"65e25f8a2e8096150a67345d162ad58b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"vancouverpetunia\"] sorry! I totally thought they were local and readily available they way they are listed in my options for our wedding package. I assumed since it wasn&#039;t an upgrade in my package that the delphiniums were local flowers. I wonder if the time of year has anything to do with it for us. Or maybe my bouquet is a premium option and I didn&#039;t even know it!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894338,"PostDate":1429915387,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281283\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281283-vancouverpetunia\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">vancouverpetunia<\/span><\/a> sorry! I totally thought they were local and readily available they way they are listed in my options for our wedding package. I assumed since it wasn't an upgrade in my package that the delphiniums were local flowers. I wonder if the time of year has anything to do with it for us. Or maybe my bouquet is a premium option and I didn't even know it!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;0\/st\/20160109\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/9fa9\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"sean.n.steph2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.12.52.42","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1415533111,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snswedding2016","Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1429915924,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"278b9309d3f11a1aac07b121775b485b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;It&#039;s so odd to compare lists. Some of your &#039;not available&#039; flowers were on my &#039;included list&#039;... &amp;nbsp; We basically had included and premium\/exotic (extra charge). &amp;nbsp;our list wasn&#039;t near as extensive as yours though. &amp;nbsp; Maybe it depends on the florists the resorts use?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;edit: love the bouquet called &#039;citris&#039; &amp;nbsp; Love the colors! &amp;nbsp;I had considered throwing in some of those &#039;green&#039; things (LOL!!!) but then decided against it and stuck to my 3 main colors. Still love the idea though!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894339,"PostDate":1429915855,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>It's so odd to compare lists. Some of your 'not available' flowers were on my 'included list'... \u00a0 We basically had included and premium\/exotic (extra charge). \u00a0our list wasn't near as extensive as yours though. \u00a0 Maybe it depends on the florists the resorts use?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>edit: love the bouquet called 'citris' \u00a0 Love the colors! \u00a0I had considered throwing in some of those 'green' things (LOL!!!) but then decided against it and stuck to my 3 main colors. Still love the idea though!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1429920635,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"659bff9e59a64c4560a8dd898b993420","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"snswedding2016\"] Don&#039;t be sorry! I have no idea if this list is accurate. Whether it is or not, in the end, it&#039;ll be the resort\/florist that sets the price.&amp;nbsp; :P&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] It is strange that the lists are so different. Like I said above, I don&#039;t know how accurate it is and in the end it doesn&#039;t really matter. The pricing I can get will be the deciding factor! At one point I was thinking of just bright, bold colors for my theme\/bouquet, which I think is what you did. I still may go that way...&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894343,"PostDate":1429920543,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281055\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281055-snswedding2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">snswedding2016<\/span><\/a> Don't be sorry! I have no idea if this list is accurate. Whether it is or not, in the end, it'll be the resort\/florist that sets the price.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> It is strange that the lists are so different. Like I said above, I don't know how accurate it is and in the end it doesn't really matter. The pricing I can get will be the deciding factor! At one point I was thinking of just bright, bold colors for my theme\/bouquet, which I think is what you did. I still may go that way...\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417435045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.231.97.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":79068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f5eca8135918cd8e68436d133333c2f3","RawContent":"[quote name=\"vancouverpetunia\" post=\"1894002\" timestamp=\"1429747499\"]\nReceived my first wedding-related online purchase today. YAY! Kimonos for me and my 2 BMs. Thanks @[member=\"eriddell\"] for posting the La Vie en Rose sale. Great deal!\n\n\n\nMy FH has also ordered gifts for his GMs - he seemed inspired when I ordered the robes. I didn&#039;t see what he ordered, so hope it&#039;s not ridiculous  :P[\/quote]\nI got those too!! lol  I got the blue for my girlfriend and I got the white one with peach. Not my colours and I haven&#039;t figured out yet if we&#039;ll get to wear them but I did get them for one heck of a great price!! Well worth it!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1894348,"PostDate":1429923059,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>vancouverpetunia, on 22 April 2015 - 08:04 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Received my first wedding-related online purchase today. YAY! Kimonos for me and my 2 BMs. Thanks\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279216\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279216-eriddell\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">eriddell<\/span><\/a> for posting the La Vie en Rose sale. Great deal!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My FH has also ordered gifts for his GMs - he seemed inspired when I ordered the robes. I didn't see what he ordered, so hope it's not ridiculous\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I got those too!! lol\u00a0 I got the blue for my girlfriend and I got the white one with peach. Not my colours and I haven't figured out yet if we'll get to wear them but I did get them for one heck of a great price!! Well worth it!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1430563582,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4340585508d0e6625847079a65d9e23c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We (or should I say HE) received some packages this week! He ordered flasks &amp;amp; bottle openers from the Chive. Not sure if you ladies are familiar with the Chive - it&#039;s a web site of some cult status and very popular among FH &amp;amp; his friends.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81123]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We also received custom golf balls for the golf outing he is planning. They say \"Mexico 2016\". He didn&#039;t want anything too specific to our wedding. He works in the golf industry so these were free. YAY!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81124]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Question - Do we need to give a gift to our MC? We didn&#039;t think about that when we ordered the Chive items. We haven&#039;t asked yet, but hoping my BIL (sister&#039;s husband) will be up to the task.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895180,"PostDate":1430563547,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We (or should I say HE) received some packages this week! He ordered flasks & bottle openers from the Chive. Not sure if you ladies are familiar with the Chive - it's a web site of some cult status and very popular among FH & his friends.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81123-chive-gm-gifts\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18009\/sml_gallery_281283_18009_416166.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='chive GM gifts'  width='150' height='200'  alt='chive GM gifts' id='sml_image_view_81123' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We also received custom golf balls for the golf outing he is planning. They say \"Mexico 2016\". He didn't want anything too specific to our wedding. He works in the golf industry so these were free. YAY!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81124-custom-golf-balls\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18009\/sml_gallery_281283_18009_289775.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='custom golf balls'  width='150' height='200'  alt='custom golf balls' id='sml_image_view_81124' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Question - Do we need to give a gift to our MC? We didn't think about that when we ordered the Chive items. We haven't asked yet, but hoping my BIL (sister's husband) will be up to the task.\u00a0<\/div>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417435045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":35,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
