&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81089]&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;My FH has also ordered gifts for his GMs - he seemed inspired when I ordered the robes. I didn&#039;t see what he ordered, so hope it&#039;s not ridiculous&amp;nbsp; :P&lt;/p&gt;[/quote]

I got mine too! What a deal and they\'re so pretty!',
