{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.117.36.109","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"95cfee882d6b9979ae14bd3579f8b7ad","RawContent":"[quote name=\"vancouverpetunia\" post=\"1895180\" timestamp=\"1430577947\"]\nWe (or should I say HE) received some packages this week! He ordered flasks &amp;amp; bottle openers from the Chive. Not sure if you ladies are familiar with the Chive - it&#039;s a web site of some cult status and very popular among FH &amp;amp; his friends.\n\n\n\nWe also received custom golf balls for the golf outing he is planning. They say \"Mexico 2016\". He didn&#039;t want anything too specific to our wedding. He works in the golf industry so these were free. YAY!\n\n\n\nQuestion - Do we need to give a gift to our MC? We didn&#039;t think about that when we ordered the Chive items. We haven&#039;t asked yet, but hoping my BIL (sister&#039;s husband) will be up to the task.[\/quote]\nWhat a great idea!!! My FI and his buddies love the Chive I&#039;m gonna have to take a look now!\n\n\nSent from my iPad using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1895232,"PostDate":1430666432,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>vancouverpetunia, on 02 May 2015 - 10:45 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>We (or should I say HE) received some packages this week! He ordered flasks & bottle openers from the Chive. Not sure if you ladies are familiar with the Chive - it's a web site of some cult status and very popular among FH & his friends.<br><br><br><br>\nWe also received custom golf balls for the golf outing he is planning. They say \"Mexico 2016\". He didn't want anything too specific to our wedding. He works in the golf industry so these were free. YAY!<br><br><br><br>\nQuestion - Do we need to give a gift to our MC? We didn't think about that when we ordered the Chive items. We haven't asked yet, but hoping my BIL (sister's husband) will be up to the task.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br><br>\nWhat a great idea!!! My FI and his buddies love the Chive I'm gonna have to take a look now!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPad using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/'>My Planning Thread<\/a>\u00a0- MeandHim - Grand Palladium Bavaro - Nov 25 2015<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;116\/st\/20151125\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/461e\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"markandshavonne@live.com","IpAddress":"70.30.85.211","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1365777659,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Meandhim","Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"526715699585194d9f7652d9f336aeda","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I love your planning thread! The story of how you met is just so cute haha so I think it&#039;s very fitting that you&#039;re having a destination wedding :).&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I love the colors you have chosen, we definitely thought about peacock colors at the beginning but then ended up changing them. I also love the pink\/orange color palette as it seems easy to find local flowers with those colors.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I was also thinking of delphiniums as an option for a blue flower. I think they&#039;re very pretty, although the painted orchids would look really nice too!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895235,"PostDate":1430670781,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I love your planning thread! The story of how you met is just so cute haha so I think it's very fitting that you're having a destination wedding <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I love the colors you have chosen, we definitely thought about peacock colors at the beginning but then ended up changing them. I also love the pink\/orange color palette as it seems easy to find local flowers with those colors.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was also thinking of delphiniums as an option for a blue flower. I think they're very pretty, although the painted orchids would look really nice too!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.18.168.1","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3091f16031c8cee95db7c43b3dd2169f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Photography&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m excited to say that we have secured a photographer. We have a friend, who is invited to the wedding and who is also a professional wedding photographer here in Vancouver. I wasn&#039;t sure if he would be interested, as I figured he might not want to work on his vacation. I also had no idea what his rates were and whether they would fit in our budget.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;But I figured it couldn&#039;t hurt to ask (as my mom says, the worst he could say is \"no\"). Turns out he is interested and his rate for 8 hours is approximately the rate for 4 hours with most of the local photographers that I contacted! Plus, he&#039;ll be on site all week, so we can split that up at no additional charge if we don&#039;t need it all for the wedding day (which I doubt we will). Oh, and that rate is in CAD rather than USD so I don&#039;t have to pay the exchange rate. Needless to say I&#039;m really happy with everything.&amp;nbsp; :D&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895313,"PostDate":1430758027,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><strong>Photography<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm excited to say that we have secured a photographer. We have a friend, who is invited to the wedding and who is also a professional wedding photographer here in Vancouver. I wasn't sure if he would be interested, as I figured he might not want to work on his vacation. I also had no idea what his rates were and whether they would fit in our budget.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>But I figured it couldn't hurt to ask (as my mom says, the worst he could say is \"no\"). Turns out he is interested and his rate for 8 hours is approximately the rate for 4 hours with most of the local photographers that I contacted! Plus, he'll be on site all week, so we can split that up at no additional charge if we don't need it all for the wedding day (which I doubt we will). Oh, and that rate is in CAD rather than USD so I don't have to pay the exchange rate. Needless to say I'm really happy with everything.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417435045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0999588d7299a787c392ed563b1913e0","RawContent":"Yay!!! That&#039;s awesome congrats :)\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1895318,"PostDate":1430767133,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yay!!! That's awesome congrats <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c42dad4329bd892ccb4b160eb0a73ab4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;that&#039;s great! When we finally booked our photographer it felt like such a huge weight had been lifted haha&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895342,"PostDate":1430786383,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>that's great! When we finally booked our photographer it felt like such a huge weight had been lifted haha<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.164.79.65","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":79068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1d7a77047ba9de66d03d3006f3380591","RawContent":"[quote name=\"vancouverpetunia\" post=\"1894002\" timestamp=\"1429733099\"]\n&amp;amp;lt;p&amp;amp;gt;Received my first wedding-related online purchase today. YAY! Kimonos for me and my 2 BMs. Thanks&amp;amp;amp;nbsp;@[member=\"eriddell\"] for posting the La Vie en Rose sale. Great deal!&amp;amp;lt;\/p&amp;amp;gt;\n&amp;amp;lt;p&amp;amp;gt;&amp;amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;amp;lt;\/p&amp;amp;gt;\n&amp;amp;lt;div&amp;amp;gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81089]&amp;amp;lt;\/div&amp;amp;gt;\n&amp;amp;lt;p&amp;amp;gt;&amp;amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;amp;lt;\/p&amp;amp;gt;\n&amp;amp;lt;p&amp;amp;gt;My FH has also ordered gifts for his GMs - he seemed inspired when I ordered the robes. I didn&#039;t see what he ordered, so hope it&#039;s not ridiculous&amp;amp;amp;nbsp; :P&amp;amp;lt;\/p&amp;amp;gt;[\/quote]I got mine too! What a deal and they&#039;re so pretty!","Attachments":[],"Id":1895344,"PostDate":1430813562,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>vancouverpetunia, on 22 April 2015 - 04:04 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p><p>Received my first wedding-related online purchase today. YAY! Kimonos for me and my 2 BMs. Thanks&amp;nbsp;@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279216\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279216-eriddell\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">eriddell<\/span><\/a> for posting the La Vie en Rose sale. Great deal!<\/p><br>\n<p>&amp;nbsp;<\/p><br>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/81089-bm-robes\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18009\/sml_gallery_281283_18009_195.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='BM robes'  width='163' height='200'  alt='BM robes' id='sml_image_view_81089' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div><br>\n<p>&amp;nbsp;<\/p><br>\n<p>My FH has also ordered gifts for his GMs - he seemed inspired when I ordered the robes. I didn't see what he ordered, so hope it's not ridiculous&amp;nbsp; <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/><\/p><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI got mine too! What a deal and they're so pretty!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":36,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
